---@field bigtableMetadata? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FeatureViewBigtableMetadata Output only. Metadata containing information about the Cloud Bigtable.
---@field syncConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FeatureViewSyncConfig Configures when data is to be synced/updated for this FeatureView. At the end of the sync the latest featureValues for each entityId of this FeatureView are made ready for online serving.
