---@field vectorSearchConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FeatureViewVectorSearchConfig Optional. Deprecated: please use FeatureView.index_config instead.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field indexConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FeatureViewIndexConfig Optional. Configuration for index preparation for vector search. It contains the required configurations to create an index from source data, so that approximate nearest neighbor (a.k.a ANN) algorithms search can be performed during online serving.
---@field bigQuerySource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FeatureViewBigQuerySource Optional. Configures how data is supposed to be extracted from a BigQuery source to be loaded onto the FeatureOnlineStore.
---@field featureRegistrySource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FeatureViewFeatureRegistrySource Optional. Configures the features from a Feature Registry source that need to be loaded onto the FeatureOnlineStore.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
