---@field outputSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ModelMonitoringOutputSpec Optional default monitoring metrics/logs export spec, it can be overridden in the ModelMonitoringJob output spec. If not specified, a default Google Cloud Storage bucket will be created under your project.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this ModelMonitor was created.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this ModelMonitor was updated most recently.
---@field name? string Immutable. Resource name of the ModelMonitor. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/modelMonitors/{model_monitor}`.
---@field trainingDataset? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ModelMonitoringInput Optional training dataset used to train the model. It can serve as a reference dataset to identify changes in production.
---@field explanationSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ExplanationSpec Optional model explanation spec. It is used for feature attribution monitoring.
---@field modelMonitorId? string Optional. The ID to use for the Model Monitor, which will become the final component of the model monitor resource name. The maximum length is 63 characters, and valid characters are `/^[a-z]([a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?$/`.
---@field parent string Required. The resource name of the Location to create the ModelMonitor in. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}`

