---@field etag? string Optional. Used to perform consistent read-modify-write updates. If not set, a blind "overwrite" update happens.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EncryptionSpec Customer-managed encryption key spec for a ReasoningEngine. If set, this ReasoningEngine and all sub-resources of this ReasoningEngine will be secured by this key.
