---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EncryptionSpec Customer-managed encryption key spec for a Tensorboard. If set, this Tensorboard and all sub-resources of this Tensorboard will be secured by this key.
