---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DownloadArtifactProjectsLocationsAgentsTasksRequest
---@field path? string Required. Absolute path of the file to read, e.g. "/workspace/report.md". Must be under "/workspace", at most 1024 characters, and not contain a ".." segment.
---@field ["processingConfig.outputMimeType"]? string Required. The media type to return: * `application/pdf`: the file as a PDF, e.g. a .docx or .pptx. * `application/json`: a spreadsheet, e.g. a .xlsx, as JSON describing its sheets and cells, from which a client draws the workbook as a grid. Any other value fails with `INVALID_ARGUMENT`.
---@field task string Required. The task to download from. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/agents/{agent}/tasks/{task}

---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DownloadMediaRequest
---@field path? string Required. Absolute path of a file in the task's workspace, e.g. `/workspace/report.md`, or, for a collaborative project, under `/workspace/project`, e.g. `/workspace/project/report.md`. Must be under `/workspace`, at most 1024 characters, and not contain a `..` segment. Accepts `TaskArtifactFile.path` as-is.
---@field ["processingConfig.outputMimeType"]? string Required. The media type of the rendition: * `application/pdf`: the file as a PDF, e.g. of a .docx, .pptx or .xlsx. * `application/json`: a spreadsheet, e.g. a .xlsx or .csv, as JSON describing its sheets and cells, from which a client draws the workbook as a grid. Any other value fails with `INVALID_ARGUMENT`.
---@field name string Required. The task or collaborative project to download from. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/agents/{agent}/tasks/{task} or projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collaborativeProjects/{collaborative_project}

---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DownloadProjectsLocationsAgentsTasksRequest
---@field path? string Required. Absolute path of a file in the task's workspace, e.g. `/workspace/report.md`, or, for a collaborative project, under `/workspace/project`, e.g. `/workspace/project/report.md`. Must be under `/workspace`, at most 1024 characters, and not contain a `..` segment. Accepts `TaskArtifactFile.path` as-is.
---@field ["processingConfig.outputMimeType"]? string Required. The media type of the rendition: * `application/pdf`: the file as a PDF, e.g. of a .docx, .pptx or .xlsx. * `application/json`: a spreadsheet, e.g. a .xlsx or .csv, as JSON describing its sheets and cells, from which a client draws the workbook as a grid. Any other value fails with `INVALID_ARGUMENT`.
---@field name string Required. The task or collaborative project to download from. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/agents/{agent}/tasks/{task} or projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collaborativeProjects/{collaborative_project}

