---@field environmentId? string Optional. The environment ID for the interaction. If specified, the request will update the existing environment instead of creating a new one.
---@field sources? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigSourceList
---@field env? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEnvVarMap Environment variables to set in the sandbox environment.
---@field memoryMounts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigMemoryMountList Optional. Memory stores mounted into the environment under `/memory/`. When merged with an agent or base environment configuration, non-conflicting mounts are preserved and request mounts take precedence on store ID or dir_name collisions.
---@field networkMode? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigNetworkModeEnum|string Network egress mode.
---@field networkAllowlist? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEnvironmentNetworkEgressAllowlist Allow only specific domains.

---A single domain allowlist rule with optional header injection.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEgressRule
---@field domain? string Domain to allow outbound requests to. Supports wildcards (e.g. '*.googleapis.com'). Use '*' to allow all domains.
---@field mode? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEgressRuleModeEnum|string Network egress mode. Set via the `"allowlist": "disabled"` short form; must be the only rule in the allowlist and cannot be combined with `domain`, `transform` or `credential`.
---@field credential? string Optional. Reference to a server-managed Credential resource by ID.
---@field transform? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap Headers to inject into requests matching this rule. Key: header name (e.g., "Authorization"). Value: header value (e.g., "Bearer your-token").

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEgressRuleList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEgressRule[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEgressRuleModeEnum "NETWORK_MODE_UNSPECIFIED"|"DISABLED"

---An environment variable to set in the execution environment.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEnvVar
---@field value? string Direct string value for plain environment variables.
---@field credential? string Optional reference to a server-managed Credential resource by ID.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEnvVarMap { [string]: gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEnvVar }

---Network egress configuration for the environment.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEnvironmentNetworkEgressAllowlist
---@field allowlist? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigEgressRuleList List of allowed domains and their configurations. Set to `"disabled"` to block all network egress.

---A memory store mounted into the environment under `/memory/`.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigMemoryMount
---@field memoryStore? string Required. Resource name or ID of the MemoryStore (e.g. `memoryStores/my-store` or `my-store`).
---@field description? string Optional. Per-mount guidance describing when the agent should read or write this memory store.
---@field mode? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigMemoryMountModeEnum|string Optional. Access mode granted to the environment for this store. Defaults to `READ_ONLY` when unspecified.
---@field dirName? string Optional. Directory name under `/memory//`. When omitted, defaults to the store's `memory_store_id`.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigMemoryMountList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigMemoryMount[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigMemoryMountModeEnum "MODE_UNSPECIFIED"|"READ_ONLY"|"READ_WRITE"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigNetworkModeEnum "NETWORK_MODE_UNSPECIFIED"|"DISABLED"

---A source to be mounted into the environment.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigSource
---@field target? string Where the source should appear in the environment.
---@field source? string The source of the environment. For Cloud Storage, this is the Cloud Storage path. For GitHub, this is the GitHub path.
---@field content? string The inline content if `type` is `INLINE`.
---@field type? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigSourceTypeEnum|string
---@field encoding? string Optional encoding for inline content (e.g. `base64`).

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigSourceList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigSource[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfigSourceTypeEnum "TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"GCS"|"INLINE"|"REPOSITORY"|"SKILL_REGISTRY"

