---Statistics on the interaction request's token usage.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsage
---@field inputTokensByModality? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensList A breakdown of input token usage by modality.
---@field totalOutputTokens? number Total number of tokens across all the generated responses.
---@field initialInputTokens? number Number of input tokens used in the first turn of this interaction.
---@field totalCachedTokens? number Number of tokens in the cached part of the prompt (the cached content).
---@field rawPromptToken? number Output only.
---@field groundingToolCount? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageGroundingToolCountList Grounding tool count.
---@field toolCallUsage? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageToolCallUsageList Output only. Per-tool call statistics, sorted by (`tool_type`, `name`).
---@field billableUsage? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageBillableUsage Accumulated billable token usage across all continuation calls.
---@field totalToolUseTokens? number Number of tokens present in tool-use prompt(s).
---@field compactionUsageMetadata? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageCompactionUsageMetadata Token usage metadata for context compaction.
---@field totalThoughtTokens? number Number of tokens of thoughts for thinking models.
---@field totalModelInvocations? number Total number of LLM model invocations executed during the interaction turn (including retries and multi-step tool loop calls).
---@field toolUseTokensByModality? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensList A breakdown of tool-use token usage by modality.
---@field cachedTokensByModality? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensList A breakdown of cached token usage by modality.
---@field modelInvocationTokenCounts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModelInvocationTokenCountsList Per-invocation token count breakdown. For simple requests, this contains a single entry. For requests with server-side tool use, this contains one entry per model invocation, ordered chronologically. This is the source of truth for billing.
---@field totalTokens? number Total token count for the interaction request (prompt + responses + other internal tokens).
---@field totalInputTokens? number Number of tokens in the prompt (context).
---@field nonGroundingModelInvocationTokenCounts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModelInvocationTokenCountsList Per-invocation token count breakdown for non-grounding invocations (grounding prompt/cache tokens excluded).
---@field outputTokensByModality? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensList A breakdown of output token usage by modality.

---Accumulated billable token usage across all continuation calls.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageBillableUsage
---@field totalTokens? number Total billable token count across all continuation calls.
---@field totalInputTokens? number Total billable input tokens across all continuation calls.
---@field totalThoughtTokens? number Total billable thought tokens across all continuation calls.
---@field totalOutputTokens? number Total billable output tokens across all continuation calls.
---@field totalCachedTokens? number Total billable cached tokens across all continuation calls.

