---The token count for a single response modality.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokens
---@field tokens? number Number of tokens for the modality.
---@field modality? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensModalityEnum The modality associated with the token count.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokens[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensModalityEnum "RESPONSE_MODALITY_UNSPECIFIED"|"TEXT"|"IMAGE"|"AUDIO"|"VIDEO"|"DOCUMENT"

---Token count breakdown for a single model invocation (main model only) within a request. For simple requests without tool use, there is a single invocation. For requests with server-side tool use, there is one invocation per tool-use iteration.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModelInvocationTokenCounts
---@field candidatesTokensDetails? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensList Per-modality breakdown of response tokens for this invocation. Includes the model's text output, function calls, or final answer. Does not include thought tokens.
---@field cacheTokensDetails? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensList Per-modality breakdown of cached tokens within this invocation's prompt. Cached tokens are discounted for billing (priced at the cache rate, not the full input rate). This is a subset of prompt_tokens_details.
---@field promptTokensDetails? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensList Per-modality breakdown of prompt tokens for this invocation. Includes all tokens sent to the model: user content, system instructions, formatting/control tokens, tool declarations, and any previous-turn context accumulated during tool use.
---@field thoughtsTokensDetails? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModalityTokensList Per-modality breakdown of thought tokens for this invocation (for thinking models). Includes auxiliary control tokens produced by the model that delimit thought blocks.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModelInvocationTokenCountsList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiInteractionUsageModelInvocationTokenCounts[]

---Usage statistics for one tool, aggregated over the interaction.
