---Response for InteractionService.CreateInteraction.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1Interaction
---@field status? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionStatusEnum|string Required. Output only. The status of the interaction.
---@field environmentId? string Output only. The environment ID for the interaction. Only populated if environment config is set in the request.
---@field stringContent? string A string input for the interaction, it will be processed as a single text input.
---@field responseFormatSingleton? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1ResponseFormat
---@field modelInteraction? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1ModelInteraction Interaction for generating the completion using models.
---@field steps? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1StepList_ Required. Output only. The steps that make up the interaction, when included in the response.
---@field envId? string The environment ID for the interaction. Can be 'remote' for default environment.
---@field updated? string Required. Output only. The time at which the response was last updated in ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssZ).
---@field errors? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1ErrorList Output only. Diagnostic faults / platform errors recorded on the interaction.
---@field responseModalities? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionResponseModalitiesItemEnumList The requested modalities of the response (TEXT, IMAGE, AUDIO).
---@field localEnvironment? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1LocalEnvironmentConfig The agent's environment lives on the client connection: its built-in environment operations (filesystem ops and running commands) are yielded to the client to execute, instead of running in a server-managed sandbox. Mutually exclusive with `remote_environment`. (Independent of any client-declared function tools, which are always executed on the client regardless of this field.)
---@field id? string Required. Output only. A unique identifier for the interaction completion.
---@field serviceTier? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionServiceTierEnum|string The service tier for the interaction.
---@field created? string Required. Output only. The time at which the response was created in ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssZ).
---@field responseFormatList? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1ResponseFormatList
---@field agentInteraction? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1AgentInteraction Interaction for generating the completion using agents.
---@field systemInstruction? string System instruction for the interaction.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata for the request. Label keys and values can be no longer than 63 characters (Unicode codepoints) and can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores, and dashes. International characters are allowed. Label values are optional. Label keys must start with a letter.
---@field previousInteractionId? string The ID of the previous interaction, if any.
---@field remoteEnvironment? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1EnvironmentConfig
---@field tools? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1ToolList A list of tool declarations the model may call during interaction.
---@field usage? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionUsage Output only. Statistics on the interaction request's token usage.
---@field content? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1Content The content for the interaction.
---@field safetySettings? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1SafetySettingList Safety settings for the interaction.
---@field responseMimeType? string The mime type of the response. This is required if response_format is set.
---@field stepList? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1StepList Input only. The steps for the interaction.
---@field continuationToken? string Opaque token to resume a long decode. Output: set when status is REQUIRES_CONTINUATION and decoding can be resumed. Input: pass the latest token back unchanged in CreateInteraction to continue decoding.

---Signals that the Interaction completed. Sent when the Interaction receives Complete/Cancel or naturally terminates. No more input can be sent to the Interaction after this.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionCompletedSseEvent
---@field interaction? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1Interaction Required. Partial completed interaction resource emitted at the end of the stream.

---Server response confirming that a new interaction was created.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionCreatedSseEvent
---@field interaction? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1Interaction Required. Partial interaction resource emitted when the stream is created.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionResponseModalitiesItemEnum "RESPONSE_MODALITY_UNSPECIFIED"|"TEXT"|"IMAGE"|"AUDIO"|"VIDEO"|"DOCUMENT"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionResponseModalitiesItemEnumList (gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionResponseModalitiesItemEnum|string)[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionServiceTierEnum "SERVICE_TIER_UNSPECIFIED"|"SERVICE_TIER_FLEX"|"SERVICE_TIER_STANDARD"|"SERVICE_TIER_PRIORITY"|"SERVICE_TIER_DEFERRED"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionStatusEnum "UNSPECIFIED"|"IN_PROGRESS"|"REQUIRES_ACTION"|"COMPLETED"|"FAILED"|"CANCELLED"|"INCOMPLETE"|"BUDGET_EXCEEDED"|"QUEUED"|"REQUIRES_CONTINUATION"

