---@field description? string Optional. Descriptive summary of vocal timbre, personality, and tone.
---@field type? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1VoiceTypeEnum|string Required. The type of the voice. In `CreateVoice`, must be `"replicated"` or `"prompted"`. In `ListVoices` responses, may also be `"prebuilt"`.
---@field model? string Optional. The model used to design or replicate the voice. If omitted in `CreateVoice`, defaults to the latest supported voice design model. Returned in `CreateVoice`, `GetVoice`, and `ListVoices` responses for custom voices (`"prompted"` and `"replicated"`); unset for `"prebuilt"` voices. Created voices can be synthesized across any supported TTS synthesis model.
---@field displayName? string Optional. User-provided display name for a stored voice (`store = true`), or the catalog name for a prebuilt voice.
---@field pitch? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1VoicePitchEnum|string Optional. Voice pitch classification.
---@field prompted? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1VoicePromptedVoice Parameters for prompted voice generation. Required in `CreateVoice` when `type` is `"prompted"`. Returned in `CreateVoice`, `GetVoice`, and `ListVoices` responses for prompted voices.
---@field key? string Output only. The client-managed voice replication key (with prefix `voicekey_`). Returned only by `CreateVoice` when `type` is `"replicated"` and `store` is `false`. Pass this key to `SpeechConfig.voice_config.voice` (or `SpeechConfig.voice`) during speech synthesis.
---@field persona? string Optional. Intended persona or character archetype (e.g. "Warm, Friendly", "Narrator").
---@field regionCode? string Optional. ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 or UN M.49 geographic region code (e.g. "US", "GB", "001").
---@field id? string Output only. The unique identifier of the voice. * For Google-managed custom voices (`store = true`), this is a generated ID with prefix `voice_` (for example, `voice_abc123def456`). Pass `voices/{id}` as the `name` in `GetVoice` and `DeleteVoice`, and pass `{id}` directly to `SpeechConfig.voice_config.voice` (or `SpeechConfig.voice`) during speech synthesis. * For prebuilt catalog voices (`"prebuilt"` returned by `ListVoices`), this is the speaker name (for example, `Puck` or `Charon`). * Unset when `CreateVoice` is called with `store = false`.
---@field context? string Optional. Optimal usage context or domain (e.g. "Conversational", "Audiobook", "News").
---@field replicated? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1VoiceReplicatedVoice Input only. Parameters for replicated voice generation. Required on input when `type` is `"replicated"`. Not returned in responses.
---@field expireTime? string Output only. The timestamp at which a custom stored voice (`store = true`) or replicated voice key (`store = false`) expires. For custom stored voices (`store = true`), this expiration time is extended when the voice is used for speech synthesis or as a `base_voice` in `CreateVoice`. Unset for prebuilt catalog voices (`"prebuilt"`), which do not expire.
---@field accent? string Optional. Regional accent descriptor (e.g. "American", "British").
---@field usage? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1InteractionUsage Output only. Token usage statistics for the voice creation request. Populated only in the response of `CreateVoice` when `type` is `"prompted"`; unset for `"replicated"` and in `GetVoice` and `ListVoices` responses.
---@field sampleAudio? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1AudioData Output only. Sample audio (synthesizer prompt audio) generated for a prompted voice. Populated only in `CreateVoice` and `GetVoice` responses when `type` is `"prompted"`; unset in `ListVoices` responses and for `"replicated"` or `"prebuilt"` voices.

