---@field sourceAudio? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1AudioData Required. The reference audio sample of the speaker's voice to replicate. Must be an unmodified recording of an adult human voice.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiVertexV1beta1VoiceTypeEnum "VOICE_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"VOICE_TYPE_REPLICATED"|"VOICE_TYPE_PROMPTED"|"VOICE_TYPE_PREBUILT"

