---@field startOffset? string Start offset in time of the word relative to the start of the audio. Present when timestamp_granularities contains "word".
---@field speaker? string Optional. Speaker label for this word (e.g. "spk_1", "spk_2"). Present when diarization_mode is set in TranscriptionConfig.
