---@field apiKeySecretVersion? string Required. The SecretManager secret version resource name storing API key. e.g. projects/{project}/secrets/{secret}/versions/{version}

---Response message for A2ATaskRecordService.AppendA2ATaskRecordEvents.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1AppendA2ATaskRecordEventsResponse
---@field generation? string Task generation matching the last event

---Response message for AppendA2aTaskEvents.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1AppendA2aTaskEventsResponse
---@field generation? string Task generation matching the last event

