---@field promptColumn? string Optional. The name of the column that contains the requests to evaluate. This will be in evaluation_item.EvalPrompt format.
---@field uri? string Required. The URI of a BigQuery table. e.g. bq://projectId.bqDatasetId.bqTableId
---@field rubricsColumn? string Optional. The name of the column that contains the rubrics. This is in evaluation_rubric.RubricGroup format.
---@field candidateResponseColumns? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap Optional. Map of candidate name to candidate response column name. The column will be in evaluation_item.CandidateResponse format.

