---@field maxToolCalls? string Optional. Maximum total tool calls across the whole task.
---@field maxWallclock? string Optional. Maximum wall-clock duration for the task. Counts only time spent in `WORKING` or `REQUIRES_ACTION`; `IDLE`, `QUEUED`, and `SUSPENDED` do not accrue.

