---A shared workspace for a user's related tasks . A CollaborativeProject is a top-level resource. Only the user who created it can read or change it.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CollaborativeProject
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time the project was created.
---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the project. The service assigns the final ID segment. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collaborativeProjects/{collaborative_project}`.
---@field displayName? string Required. The user-visible name of the project. At most 256 characters.
---@field trustedParticipants? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TrustedParticipantList Optional. Unordered list. The participants granted access to the project. Each `(participant_type, identifier)` pair can appear at most once.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The time the project was last updated.
---@field emoji? string Optional. The emoji shown as the project's icon.
---@field folder? string Optional. The full path of the local folder that backs the project, for a project created in the desktop app. Empty for a project created anywhere else.

---Scopes a task to a `CollaborativeProject` . Starts with the collaborative project resource reference; extensible with per-task collaborative project settings without a breaking change.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CollaborativeProjectConfig
---@field collaborativeProject? string Optional. The resource name of the `CollaborativeProject` this task is scoped to: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collaborativeProjects/{collaborative_project}` The `{project}` segment must match the task's own Google Cloud project. Empty when the task is not scoped to a collaborative project. Only a root task (`parent_task_id` unset) may set or update this field; when `parent_task_id` is set, the subtask automatically inherits its root task's collaborative project (setting a different value is rejected with `INVALID_ARGUMENT`). Updating or clearing this field via `UpdateTask` is only allowed while the task is in the `IDLE` state (attempts in any other state are rejected with `FAILED_PRECONDITION`).

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CollaborativeProjectList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CollaborativeProject[]

