---@field weight? number How much this single reward contributes to the total overall reward. Total reward is a linear combination of single rewards with their corresponding weights, i.e., ``` total_reward = ( weight_a * reward_a + weight_b * reward_b + ... ) / (weight_a + weight_b + ...) ```
---@field rewardConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SingleReinforcementTuningRewardConfig Single reward configuration.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CompositeReinforcementTuningRewardConfigWeightedRewardConfigList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CompositeReinforcementTuningRewardConfigWeightedRewardConfig[]

