---@field imageUri? string Required. The URI of a container image in the Container Registry that is to be run on each worker replica.
---@field command? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList The command to be invoked when the container is started. It overrides the entrypoint instruction in Dockerfile when provided.

---The structured data content of a message. A Content message contains a `role` field, which indicates the producer of the content, and a `parts` field, which contains the multi-part data of the message.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Content
---@field role? string Optional. The producer of the content. Must be either 'user' or 'model'. If not set, the service will default to 'user'.
---@field parts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PartList Required. A list of Part objects that make up a single message. Parts of a message can have different MIME types. A Content message must have at least one Part.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Content[]

---Map of placeholder in metric prompt template to contents of model input.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentMap
---@field values? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentMapContentsMap Optional. Map of placeholder to contents.

---Repeated Content type.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentMapContents
---@field contents? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentList Optional. Repeated contents.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentMapContentsMap { [string]: gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentMapContents }

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentMap_ { [string]: gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Content }

