---@field expectedContents? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentsExampleExpectedContentList Required. The expected output for the given `contents`. To represent multi-step reasoning, this is a repeated field that contains the iterative steps of the expected output.

---A single step of the expected output.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentsExampleExpectedContent
---@field content? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Content Required. A single step's content.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentsExampleExpectedContentList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentsExampleExpectedContent[]

---Instance of a general context.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Context
---@field description? string Description of the Context
---@field schemaTitle? string The title of the schema describing the metadata. Schema title and version is expected to be registered in earlier Create Schema calls. And both are used together as unique identifiers to identify schemas within the local metadata store.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this Context was last updated.
---@field name? string Immutable. The resource name of the Context.
---@field parentContexts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Output only. A list of resource names of Contexts that are parents of this Context. A Context may have at most 10 parent_contexts.
---@field displayName? string User provided display name of the Context. May be up to 128 Unicode characters.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to organize your Contexts. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. No more than 64 user labels can be associated with one Context (System labels are excluded).
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this Context was created.
---@field etag? string An eTag used to perform consistent read-modify-write updates. If not set, a blind "overwrite" update happens.
---@field schemaVersion? string The version of the schema in schema_name to use. Schema title and version is expected to be registered in earlier Create Schema calls. And both are used together as unique identifiers to identify schemas within the local metadata store.
---@field metadata? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DocumentMap Properties of the Context. Top level metadata keys' heading and trailing spaces will be trimmed. The size of this field should not exceed 200KB.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContextList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Context[]

---The scoped context a task runs within.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContextScope
---@field localEnvironment? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiLocalEnvironmentConfig Optional. Optional client-side ("local") environment: the agent's built-in filesystem/shell operations are yielded to the connecting client (e.g. the gogo desktop client) to execute locally, instead of running in a server-managed sandbox. Mirrors Interaction.local_environment and is mutually exclusive with `environment`. (Independent of any client-declared function tools, which are always executed on the client regardless of this field.)
---@field dataConnectorConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DataConnectorConfig Optional. Data connector configuration for this task.
---@field collaborativeProject? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CollaborativeProjectConfig Optional. Optional collaborative project configuration for this task. Only a root task (`parent_task_id` unset) may set or update this field; when `parent_task_id` is set, the subtask automatically inherits its root task's collaborative project (setting a different value is rejected with `INVALID_ARGUMENT`). Updating or clearing this field via `UpdateTask` is only allowed while the task is in the `IDLE` state (attempts in any other state are rejected with `FAILED_PRECONDITION`).
---@field environment? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GenaiEnvironmentConfig Optional. Optional server-managed sandbox environment for the task: skills and tools mounted into the sandbox plus the egress policy. Reuses the Interactions EnvironmentConfig (e.g. SKILL_REGISTRY sources to mount skills, network egress allowlist).
---@field excludedTools? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolRefs Remove these tools from the agent's inherited set.
---@field externalMount? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ExternalMount Optional. Optional directory on the connecting client mounted into the task's server-managed environment. File operations under its `mount_path` are relayed to the client. Supported only when `environment` is set.
---@field allowedTools? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolRefs Keep only these tools from the agent's inherited set.
---@field memoryConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskMemoryConfig Optional. Memory settings for this task.
---@field externalBrowser? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ExternalBrowser Optional. Optional browser on the connecting client that the task's browser actions run on, instead of a browser in a server-managed sandbox. Supported with `environment`, `no_environment`, or no `environment_config`.

---Represents a single turn/invocation in the conversation.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ConversationTurn
---@field turnIndex? number Required. The 0-based index of the turn in the conversation sequence.
---@field turnId? string Optional. A unique identifier for the turn. Useful for referencing specific turns across systems.
---@field events? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1AgentEventList Optional. The list of events that occurred during this turn.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ConversationTurnList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ConversationTurn[]

