---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CorpusStatusStateEnum|string Output only. RagCorpus life state.
---@field errorStatus? string Output only. Only when the `state` field is ERROR.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CorpusStatusStateEnum "UNKNOWN"|"INITIALIZED"|"ACTIVE"|"ERROR"

---Parameters that can be overrided per request.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CorroborateContentRequestParameters
---@field citationThreshold? number Optional. Only return claims with citation score larger than the threshold.

---Response message for CorroborateContent.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CorroborateContentResponse
