---@field notebookExecutionJobId? string Optional. User specified ID for the NotebookExecutionJob.
---@field notebookExecutionJob? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJob Required. The NotebookExecutionJob to create.

