---@field sum? number Output only. Sum of a given population of values.
---@field max? number Output only. The maximum of the population values.
---@field mean? number Output only. The arithmetic mean of the values in the population.
---@field p5? number Output only. The 5th percentile of the values in the population.
---@field buckets? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetDistributionDistributionBucketList Output only. Defines the histogram bucket.
---@field min? number Output only. The minimum of the population values.
---@field p95? number Output only. The 95th percentile of the values in the population.

---Dataset bucket used to create a histogram for the distribution given a population of values.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetDistributionDistributionBucket
---@field count? string Output only. Number of values in the bucket.
---@field right? number Output only. Right bound of the bucket.
---@field left? number Output only. Left bound of the bucket.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetDistributionDistributionBucketList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetDistributionDistributionBucket[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Dataset[]

---Statistics computed over a tuning dataset.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetStats
---@field tuningDatasetExampleCount? string Output only. Number of examples in the tuning dataset.
---@field droppedExampleReasons? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Output only. For each index in `dropped_example_indices`, the user-facing reason why the example was dropped.
---@field tuningStepCount? string Output only. Number of tuning steps for this Tuning Job.
---@field contentsPerExampleDistribution? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetDistribution Output only. Dataset distributions for the number of contents per example.
---@field totalBillableTokenCount? string Output only. Number of billable tokens in the tuning dataset.
---@field droppedExampleIndices? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Output only. A partial sample of the indices (starting from 1) of the dropped examples.
---@field userInputTokenDistribution? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetDistribution Output only. Dataset distributions for the user input tokens.
---@field totalTuningCharacterCount? string Output only. Number of tuning characters in the tuning dataset.
---@field totalBillableCharacterCount? string Output only. Number of billable characters in the tuning dataset.
---@field userOutputTokenDistribution? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetDistribution Output only. Dataset distributions for the user output tokens.
---@field userDatasetExamples? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentList Output only. Sample user messages in the training dataset uri.
---@field userMessagePerExampleDistribution? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetDistribution Output only. Dataset distributions for the messages per example.
---@field reinforcementTuningUserDatasetExamples? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ReinforcementTuningUserDatasetExamples Output only. Sample user dataset examples in the training dataset uri for Reinforcement Tuning.

---Describes the dataset version.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DatasetVersion
---@field bigQueryDatasetName? string Output only. Name of the associated BigQuery dataset.
---@field name? string Output only. Identifier. The resource name of the DatasetVersion. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/datasets/{dataset}/datasetVersions/{dataset_version}`
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field metadata? any Required. Output only. Additional information about the DatasetVersion.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this DatasetVersion was created.
---@field etag? string Used to perform consistent read-modify-write updates. If not set, a blind "overwrite" update happens.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this DatasetVersion was last updated.
---@field modelReference? string Output only. Reference to the public base model last used by the dataset version. Only set for prompt dataset versions.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
