---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DeployedModelRef
---@field deployedModelId? string Immutable. An ID of a DeployedModel in the above Endpoint.
---@field endpoint? string Immutable. A resource name of an Endpoint.
---@field checkpointId? string Immutable. The ID of the Checkpoint deployed in the DeployedModel.

