---Hyperparameters for Distillation.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DistillationHyperParameters
---@field epochCount? string Optional. Number of complete passes the model makes over the entire training dataset during training.
---@field batchSize? string Optional. Batch size for tuning. This feature is only available for open source models.
---@field learningRate? number Optional. Specifies the learning rate for tuning. Mutually exclusive with `learning_rate_multiplier`. This feature is only available for open source models.
---@field adapterSize? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DistillationHyperParametersAdapterSizeEnum|string Optional. Adapter size for distillation.
---@field learningRateMultiplier? number Optional. Multiplier for adjusting the default learning rate.

