---Tuning Spec for Distillation.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DistillationSpec
---@field validationDatasetUri? string Optional. Cloud Storage path to file containing validation dataset for tuning. The dataset must be formatted as a JSONL file.
---@field promptDatasetUri? string Optional. Cloud Storage path to file containing prompt dataset for distillation. The dataset must be formatted as a JSONL file.
---@field tuningMode? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DistillationSpecTuningModeEnum|string Optional. Specifies the tuning mode for distillation (sft part). This feature is only available for open source models.
---@field trainingDatasetUri? string Deprecated. Cloud Storage path to file containing training dataset for tuning. The dataset must be formatted as a JSONL file.
---@field baseTeacherModel? string The base teacher model that is being distilled. See [Supported models](https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/model-reference/tuning#supported_models).
---@field pipelineRootDirectory? string Deprecated. A path in a Cloud Storage bucket, which will be treated as the root output directory of the distillation pipeline. It is used by the system to generate the paths of output artifacts.
---@field tunedTeacherModelSource? string The resource name of the Tuned teacher model. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/models/{model}`.
---@field studentModel? string The student model that is being tuned, e.g., "google/gemma-2b-1.1-it". Deprecated. Use base_model instead.
