---@field name? string Required. Name of the environment variable. Must be a valid C identifier.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EnvVarList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EnvVar[]

