---@field createTime? string Output only. The time when the EvaluationMetric was created.
---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the EvaluationMetric. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/evaluationMetrics/{evaluation_metric}`
---@field displayName? string Required. The user-friendly display name for the EvaluationMetric.
