---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FeatureNoiseSigmaNoiseSigmaForFeatureList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FeatureNoiseSigmaNoiseSigmaForFeature[]

