---Format for Gemini examples used for Vertex Multimodal datasets.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GeminiExample
---@field safetySettings? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySettingList Optional. Per request settings for blocking unsafe content. Enforced on GenerateContentResponse.candidates.
---@field model? string Optional. The fully qualified name of the publisher model or tuned model endpoint to use. Publisher model format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/publishers/*/models/*` Tuned model endpoint format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/endpoints/{endpoint}`
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap Optional. The labels with user-defined metadata for the request. It is used for billing and reporting only. Label keys and values can be no longer than 63 characters (Unicode codepoints) and can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores, and dashes. International characters are allowed. Label values are optional. Label keys must start with a letter.
---@field tools? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolList Optional. A list of `Tools` the model may use to generate the next response. A `Tool` is a piece of code that enables the system to interact with external systems to perform an action, or set of actions, outside of knowledge and scope of the model.
---@field generationConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GenerationConfig Optional. Generation config.
---@field systemInstruction? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Content Optional. The user provided system instructions for the model. Note: only text should be used in parts and content in each part will be in a separate paragraph.
---@field cachedContent? string Optional. The name of the cached content used as context to serve the prediction. Note: only used in explicit caching, where users can have control over caching (e.g. what content to cache) and enjoy guaranteed cost savings. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/cachedContents/{cachedContent}`
---@field contents? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentList Required. The content of the current conversation with the model. For single-turn queries, this is a single instance. For multi-turn queries, this is a repeated field that contains conversation history + latest request.
---@field toolConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolConfig Optional. Tool config. This config is shared for all tools provided in the request.
---@field modelArmorConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ModelArmorConfig Optional. Settings for prompt and response sanitization using the Model Armor service. If supplied, safety_settings must not be supplied.

