---@field image? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GroundingChunkImage A grounding chunk from an image search result. See the `Image` message for details.
---@field maps? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GroundingChunkMaps A grounding chunk from Google Maps. See the `Maps` message for details.
---@field web? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GroundingChunkWeb A grounding chunk from a web page, typically from Google Search. See the `Web` message for details.
