---@field googleMapsUri? string A link to show the review on Google Maps.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GroundingChunkMapsPlaceAnswerSourcesReviewSnippetList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GroundingChunkMapsPlaceAnswerSourcesReviewSnippet[]

