---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ListAnalyzedSessionsResponseViewSummary
---@field totalSessionsCount? number Total number of sessions.
---@field anomalousAgentsCount? number Output only. The number of distinct agents in the request scope with at least one anomalous session in the time window. On `AggregateAnalyzedSessionsResponse.summary` this is a global count; it is not populated on `ListAnalyzedSessionsResponse.summary`.
