---@field description? string Required. Represents the description of the memory topic. This should explain what information should be extracted for this topic.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1MemoryBankCustomizationConfigMemoryTopicList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1MemoryBankCustomizationConfigMemoryTopic[]

