---@field generationRule? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1MemoryGenerationTriggerConfigGenerationTriggerRule Optional. Represents the active rule that determines when to flush the buffer. If not set, then the stream will be force flushed immediately.

---Represents the active rule that determines when to flush the buffer.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1MemoryGenerationTriggerConfigGenerationTriggerRule
