---@field baselineStats? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ModelMonitoringStatsDataPointTypedValue Statistics from baseline dataset.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ModelMonitoringStatsDataPointList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ModelMonitoringStatsDataPoint[]

