---Represents a Neural Architecture Search (NAS) job.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJob
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to organize NasJobs. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels.
---@field name? string Output only. Resource name of the NasJob.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field error? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. Only populated when job's state is JOB_STATE_FAILED or JOB_STATE_CANCELLED.
---@field nasJobOutput? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobOutput Output only. Output of the NasJob.
---@field endTime? string Output only. Time when the NasJob entered any of the following states: `JOB_STATE_SUCCEEDED`, `JOB_STATE_FAILED`, `JOB_STATE_CANCELLED`.
---@field startTime? string Output only. Time when the NasJob for the first time entered the `JOB_STATE_RUNNING` state.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobStateEnum Output only. The detailed state of the job.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Time when the NasJob was created.
---@field nasJobSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpec Required. The specification of a NasJob.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EncryptionSpec Customer-managed encryption key options for a NasJob. If this is set, then all resources created by the NasJob will be encrypted with the provided encryption key.
---@field enableRestrictedImageTraining? boolean Optional. Enable a separation of Custom model training and restricted image training for tenant project.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Time when the NasJob was most recently updated.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the NasJob. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJob[]

---Represents a uCAIP NasJob output.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobOutput
---@field multiTrialJobOutput? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobOutputMultiTrialJobOutput Output only. The output of this multi-trial Neural Architecture Search (NAS) job.

---The output of a multi-trial Neural Architecture Search (NAS) jobs.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobOutputMultiTrialJobOutput
---@field searchTrials? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrialList Output only. List of NasTrials that were started as part of search stage.
---@field trainTrials? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrialList Output only. List of NasTrials that were started as part of train stage.

---Represents the spec of a NasJob.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpec
---@field resumeNasJobId? string The ID of the existing NasJob in the same Project and Location which will be used to resume search. search_space_spec and nas_algorithm_spec are obtained from previous NasJob hence should not provide them again for this NasJob.
---@field searchSpaceSpec? string It defines the search space for Neural Architecture Search (NAS).
---@field multiTrialAlgorithmSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpec The spec of multi-trial algorithms.

---The spec of multi-trial Neural Architecture Search (NAS).
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpec
---@field trainTrialSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecTrainTrialSpec Spec for train trials. Top N [TrainTrialSpec.max_parallel_trial_count] search trials will be trained for every M [TrainTrialSpec.frequency] trials searched.
---@field searchTrialSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecSearchTrialSpec Required. Spec for search trials.
---@field multiTrialAlgorithm? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmEnum|string The multi-trial Neural Architecture Search (NAS) algorithm type. Defaults to `REINFORCEMENT_LEARNING`.
---@field metric? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecMetricSpec Metric specs for the NAS job. Validation for this field is done at `multi_trial_algorithm_spec` field.

---Represents a metric to optimize.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecMetricSpec
---@field goal? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecMetricSpecGoalEnum|string Required. The optimization goal of the metric.
---@field metricId? string Required. The ID of the metric. Must not contain whitespaces.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecMetricSpecGoalEnum "GOAL_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"MAXIMIZE"|"MINIMIZE"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmEnum "MULTI_TRIAL_ALGORITHM_UNSPECIFIED"|"REINFORCEMENT_LEARNING"|"GRID_SEARCH"

---Represent spec for search trials.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecSearchTrialSpec
---@field searchTrialJobSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CustomJobSpec Required. The spec of a search trial job. The same spec applies to all search trials.
---@field maxParallelTrialCount? number Required. The maximum number of trials to run in parallel.
---@field maxFailedTrialCount? number The number of failed trials that need to be seen before failing the NasJob. If set to 0, Vertex AI decides how many trials must fail before the whole job fails.
---@field maxTrialCount? number Required. The maximum number of Neural Architecture Search (NAS) trials to run.

---Represent spec for train trials.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobSpecMultiTrialAlgorithmSpecTrainTrialSpec
---@field maxParallelTrialCount? number Required. The maximum number of trials to run in parallel.
---@field frequency? number Required. Frequency of search trials to start train stage. Top N [TrainTrialSpec.max_parallel_trial_count] search trials will be trained for every M [TrainTrialSpec.frequency] trials searched.
---@field trainTrialJobSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CustomJobSpec Required. The spec of a train trial job. The same spec applies to all train trials.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasJobStateEnum "JOB_STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"JOB_STATE_QUEUED"|"JOB_STATE_PENDING"|"JOB_STATE_RUNNING"|"JOB_STATE_SUCCEEDED"|"JOB_STATE_FAILED"|"JOB_STATE_CANCELLING"|"JOB_STATE_CANCELLED"|"JOB_STATE_PAUSED"|"JOB_STATE_EXPIRED"|"JOB_STATE_UPDATING"|"JOB_STATE_PARTIALLY_SUCCEEDED"

---Represents a uCAIP NasJob trial.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrial
---@field endTime? string Output only. Time when the NasTrial's status changed to `SUCCEEDED` or `INFEASIBLE`.
---@field startTime? string Output only. Time when the NasTrial was started.
---@field id? string Output only. The identifier of the NasTrial assigned by the service.
---@field finalMeasurement? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Measurement Output only. The final measurement containing the objective value.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrialStateEnum|string Output only. The detailed state of the NasTrial.

---Represents a NasTrial details along with its parameters. If there is a corresponding train NasTrial, the train NasTrial is also returned.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrialDetail
---@field searchTrial? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrial The requested search NasTrial.
---@field name? string Output only. Resource name of the NasTrialDetail.
---@field parameters? string The parameters for the NasJob NasTrial.
---@field trainTrial? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrial The train NasTrial corresponding to search_trial. Only populated if search_trial is used for training.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrialDetailList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrialDetail[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrialList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrial[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NasTrialStateEnum "STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"REQUESTED"|"ACTIVE"|"STOPPING"|"SUCCEEDED"|"INFEASIBLE"

---A query to find a number of similar entities.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQuery
---@field embedding? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryEmbedding Optional. The embedding vector that be used for similar search.
---@field entityId? string Optional. The entity id whose similar entities should be searched for. If embedding is set, search will use embedding instead of entity_id.
---@field numericFilters? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryNumericFilterList Optional. The list of numeric filters.
---@field perCrowdingAttributeNeighborCount? number Optional. Crowding is a constraint on a neighbor list produced by nearest neighbor search requiring that no more than sper_crowding_attribute_neighbor_count of the k neighbors returned have the same value of crowding_attribute. It's used for improving result diversity.
---@field parameters? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryParameters Optional. Parameters that can be set to tune query on the fly.
---@field neighborCount? number Optional. The number of similar entities to be retrieved from feature view for each query.
---@field stringFilters? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryStringFilterList Optional. The list of string filters.

---The embedding vector.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryEmbedding
---@field value? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DoubleList Optional. Individual value in the embedding.

---Numeric filter is used to search a subset of the entities by using boolean rules on numeric columns. For example: Database Point 0: {name: "a" value_int: 42} {name: "b" value_float: 1.0} Database Point 1: {name: "a" value_int: 10} {name: "b" value_float: 2.0} Database Point 2: {name: "a" value_int: -1} {name: "b" value_float: 3.0} Query: {name: "a" value_int: 12 operator: LESS} // Matches Point 1, 2 {name: "b" value_float: 2.0 operator: EQUAL} // Matches Point 1
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryNumericFilter
---@field valueFloat? number float value type.
---@field valueInt? string int value type.
---@field name? string Required. Column name in BigQuery that used as filters.
---@field op? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryNumericFilterOpEnum|string Optional. This MUST be specified for queries and must NOT be specified for database points.
---@field valueDouble? number double value type.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryNumericFilterList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryNumericFilter[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryNumericFilterOpEnum "OPERATOR_UNSPECIFIED"|"LESS"|"LESS_EQUAL"|"EQUAL"|"GREATER_EQUAL"|"GREATER"|"NOT_EQUAL"

---Parameters that can be overrided in each query to tune query latency and recall.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryParameters
---@field approximateNeighborCandidates? number Optional. The number of neighbors to find via approximate search before exact reordering is performed; if set, this value must be > neighbor_count.
---@field leafNodesSearchFraction? number Optional. The fraction of the number of leaves to search, set at query time allows user to tune search performance. This value increase result in both search accuracy and latency increase. The value should be between 0.0 and 1.0.

---String filter is used to search a subset of the entities by using boolean rules on string columns. For example: if a query specifies string filter with 'name = color, allow_tokens = {red, blue}, deny_tokens = {purple}',' then that query will match entities that are red or blue, but if those points are also purple, then they will be excluded even if they are red/blue. Only string filter is supported for now, numeric filter will be supported in the near future.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryStringFilter
---@field allowTokens? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Optional. The allowed tokens.
---@field name? string Required. Column names in BigQuery that used as filters.
---@field denyTokens? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Optional. The denied tokens.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryStringFilterList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborQueryStringFilter[]

---Nearest neighbors for one query.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighbors
---@field neighbors? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborsNeighborList All its neighbors.

---A neighbor of the query vector.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborsNeighbor
---@field entityId? string The id of the similar entity.
---@field entityKeyValues? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FetchFeatureValuesResponse The attributes of the neighbor, e.g. filters, crowding and metadata Note that full entities are returned only when "return_full_entity" is set to true. Otherwise, only the "entity_id" and "distance" fields are populated.
---@field distance? number The distance between the neighbor and the query vector.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborsNeighborList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NearestNeighborsNeighbor[]

---Neighbors for example-based explanations.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Neighbor
---@field neighborId? string Output only. The neighbor id.
---@field neighborDistance? number Output only. The neighbor distance.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NeighborList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Neighbor[]

---Network spec.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NetworkSpec
---@field enableInternetAccess? boolean Whether to enable public internet access. Default false.
---@field subnetwork? string The name of the subnet that this instance is in. Format: `projects/{project_id_or_number}/regions/{region}/subnetworks/{subnetwork_id}`
---@field network? string The full name of the Google Compute Engine [network](https://cloud.google.com//compute/docs/networks-and-firewalls#networks)

---Represents a mount configuration for Network File System (NFS) to mount.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NfsMount
---@field path? string Required. Source path exported from NFS server. Has to start with '/', and combined with the ip address, it indicates the source mount path in the form of `server:path`
---@field mountPoint? string Required. Destination mount path. The NFS will be mounted for the user under /mnt/nfs/
---@field server? string Required. IP address of the NFS server.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NfsMountList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NfsMount[]

---An automated natural-language criterion evaluated by an autorater/agent. Wrapped in a message (rather than a bare string) so evaluation parameters (e.g. model, temperature, language) can be added without a breaking change.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NlCriteria
---@field criteria? string Required. The rubric to evaluate (e.g. "Every unread high-priority thread has a summary and a draft").

---The euc configuration of NotebookRuntimeTemplate.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookEucConfig
---@field eucDisabled? boolean Input only. Whether EUC is disabled in this NotebookRuntimeTemplate. In proto3, the default value of a boolean is false. In this way, by default EUC will be enabled for NotebookRuntimeTemplate.
---@field bypassActasCheck? boolean Output only. Whether ActAs check is bypassed for service account attached to the VM. If false, we need ActAs check for the default Compute Engine Service account. When a Runtime is created, a VM is allocated using Default Compute Engine Service Account. Any user requesting to use this Runtime requires Service Account User (ActAs) permission over this SA. If true, Runtime owner is using EUC and does not require the above permission as VM no longer use default Compute Engine SA, but a P4SA.

---NotebookExecutionJob represents an instance of a notebook execution.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJob
---@field executionTimeout? string Max running time of the execution job in seconds (default 86400s / 24 hrs).
---@field serviceAccount? string The service account to run the execution as.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this NotebookExecutionJob was created.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to organize NotebookExecutionJobs. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels. System reserved label keys are prefixed with "aiplatform.googleapis.com/" and are immutable.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of this NotebookExecutionJob. Format: `projects/{project_id}/locations/{location}/notebookExecutionJobs/{job_id}`
---@field workbenchRuntime? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobWorkbenchRuntime The Workbench runtime configuration to use for the notebook execution.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this NotebookExecutionJob was most recently updated.
---@field displayName? string The display name of the NotebookExecutionJob. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters.
---@field directNotebookSource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobDirectNotebookSource The contents of an input notebook file.
---@field customEnvironmentSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobCustomEnvironmentSpec The custom compute configuration for an execution job.
---@field gcsOutputUri? string The Cloud Storage location to upload the result to. Format: `gs://bucket-name`
---@field dataformRepositorySource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobDataformRepositorySource The Dataform Repository pointing to a single file notebook repository.
---@field kernelName? string The name of the kernel to use during notebook execution. If unset, the default kernel is used.
---@field status? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. Populated when the NotebookExecutionJob is completed. When there is an error during notebook execution, the error details are populated.
---@field executionUser? string The user email to run the execution as. Only supported by Colab runtimes.
---@field gcsNotebookSource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobGcsNotebookSource The Cloud Storage url pointing to the ipynb file. Format: `gs://bucket/notebook_file.ipynb`
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EncryptionSpec Customer-managed encryption key spec for the notebook execution job. This field is auto-populated if the NotebookRuntimeTemplate has an encryption spec.
---@field notebookRuntimeTemplateResourceName? string The NotebookRuntimeTemplate to source compute configuration from.
---@field scheduleResourceName? string The Schedule resource name if this job is triggered by one. Format: `projects/{project_id}/locations/{location}/schedules/{schedule_id}`
---@field jobState? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobJobStateEnum|string Output only. The state of the NotebookExecutionJob.

---Compute configuration to use for an execution job.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobCustomEnvironmentSpec
---@field shieldedInstanceConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobCustomEnvironmentSpecShieldedInstanceConfig Optional. Shielded VM configuration (for example, Secure Boot) for the execution VM.
---@field persistentDiskSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PersistentDiskSpec The specification of a persistent disk to attach for the execution job.
---@field machineSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1MachineSpec The specification of a single machine for the execution job.
---@field networkSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NetworkSpec The network configuration to use for the execution job.

---A set of Shielded VM options for the execution VM. Mirrors `google.cloud.notebooks.v2.ShieldedInstanceConfig`. See https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/instances/modifying-shielded-vm.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobCustomEnvironmentSpecShieldedInstanceConfig
---@field enableIntegrityMonitoring? boolean Optional. Whether the VM instance has integrity monitoring enabled.
---@field enableVtpm? boolean Optional. Whether the VM instance has vTPM enabled.
---@field enableSecureBoot? boolean Optional. Whether the VM instance has Secure Boot enabled. Disabled by default.

---The Dataform Repository containing the input notebook.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobDataformRepositorySource
---@field dataformRepositoryResourceName? string The resource name of the Dataform Repository. Format: `projects/{project_id}/locations/{location}/repositories/{repository_id}`
---@field commitSha? string The commit SHA to read repository with. If unset, the file will be read at HEAD.

---The content of the input notebook in ipynb format.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobDirectNotebookSource
---@field content? string The base64-encoded contents of the input notebook file.

---The Cloud Storage uri for the input notebook.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobGcsNotebookSource
---@field uri? string The Cloud Storage uri pointing to the ipynb file. Format: `gs://bucket/notebook_file.ipynb`
---@field generation? string The version of the Cloud Storage object to read. If unset, the current version of the object is read. See https://cloud.google.com/storage/docs/metadata#generation-number.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobJobStateEnum "JOB_STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"JOB_STATE_QUEUED"|"JOB_STATE_PENDING"|"JOB_STATE_RUNNING"|"JOB_STATE_SUCCEEDED"|"JOB_STATE_FAILED"|"JOB_STATE_CANCELLING"|"JOB_STATE_CANCELLED"|"JOB_STATE_PAUSED"|"JOB_STATE_EXPIRED"|"JOB_STATE_UPDATING"|"JOB_STATE_PARTIALLY_SUCCEEDED"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJob[]

---Configuration for a Workbench Instances-based environment.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobWorkbenchRuntime
---@field vmImage? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobWorkbenchRuntimeVmImage A specific Compute Engine VM image to run the notebook on.
---@field customContainerImage? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobWorkbenchRuntimeContainerImage A user-provided container image. The notebook executes inside this container on a managed container-host (COS) VM.

---The definition of a user-provided container image to run the notebook execution in. Mirrors `google.cloud.notebooks.v2.ContainerImage`.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobWorkbenchRuntimeContainerImage
---@field repository? string Required. The path to the container image repository. For example: `gcr.io/{project_id}/{image_name}`.
---@field tag? string Optional. The tag of the container image. If unset, defaults to `latest`.

---The definition of a Compute Engine VM image to run the notebook execution on. Mirrors `google.cloud.notebooks.v2.VmImage`.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookExecutionJobWorkbenchRuntimeVmImage
---@field name? string Use this VM image name to find the image.
---@field family? string Use this VM image family to find the image; the newest image in this family is used.
---@field project? string Required. The name of the Google Cloud project that this VM image belongs to. Format: `{project_id}`.

---The idle shutdown configuration of NotebookRuntimeTemplate, which contains the idle_timeout as required field.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookIdleShutdownConfig
---@field idleTimeout? string Required. Duration is accurate to the second. In Notebook, Idle Timeout is accurate to minute so the range of idle_timeout (second) is: 10 * 60 ~ 1440 * 60.
---@field idleShutdownDisabled? boolean Whether Idle Shutdown is disabled in this NotebookRuntimeTemplate.

---Notebook Reservation Affinity for consuming Zonal reservation.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookReservationAffinity
---@field key? string Optional. Corresponds to the label key of a reservation resource. To target a RESERVATION_SPECIFIC by name, use compute.googleapis.com/reservation-name as the key and specify the name of your reservation as its value.
---@field consumeReservationType? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookReservationAffinityConsumeReservationTypeEnum|string Required. Specifies the type of reservation from which this instance can consume resources: RESERVATION_ANY (default), RESERVATION_SPECIFIC, or RESERVATION_NONE. See Consuming reserved instances for examples.
---@field values? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Optional. Corresponds to the label values of a reservation resource. This must be the full path name of Reservation.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookReservationAffinityConsumeReservationTypeEnum "RESERVATION_AFFINITY_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"RESERVATION_NONE"|"RESERVATION_ANY"|"RESERVATION_SPECIFIC"

---A runtime is a virtual machine allocated to a particular user for a particular Notebook file on temporary basis with lifetime. Default runtimes have a lifetime of 18 hours, while custom runtimes last for 6 months from their creation or last upgrade.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntime
---@field reservationAffinity? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookReservationAffinity Output only. Reservation Affinity of the notebook runtime.
---@field isUpgradable? boolean Output only. Whether NotebookRuntime is upgradable.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to organize your NotebookRuntime. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. No more than 64 user labels can be associated with one NotebookRuntime (System labels are excluded). See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels. System reserved label keys are prefixed with "aiplatform.googleapis.com/" and are immutable. Following system labels exist for NotebookRuntime: * "aiplatform.googleapis.com/notebook_runtime_gce_instance_id": output only, its value is the Compute Engine instance id. * "aiplatform.googleapis.com/colab_enterprise_entry_service": its value is either "bigquery" or "vertex"; if absent, it should be "vertex". This is to describe the entry service, either BigQuery or Vertex.
---@field serviceAccount? string Output only. Deprecated: This field is no longer used and the "Vertex AI Notebook Service Account" (service-PROJECT_NUMBER@gcp-sa-aiplatform-vm.iam.gserviceaccount.com) is used for the runtime workload identity. See https://cloud.google.com/iam/docs/service-agents#vertex-ai-notebook-service-account for more details. The service account that the NotebookRuntime workload runs as.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field networkSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NetworkSpec Output only. Network spec of the notebook runtime.
---@field networkTags? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Optional. The Compute Engine tags to add to runtime (see [Tagging instances](https://cloud.google.com/vpc/docs/add-remove-network-tags)).
---@field dataPersistentDiskSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PersistentDiskSpec Output only. The specification of persistent disk attached to the notebook runtime as data disk storage.
---@field version? string Output only. The VM os image version of NotebookRuntime.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this NotebookRuntime was created.
---@field idleShutdownConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookIdleShutdownConfig Output only. The idle shutdown configuration of the notebook runtime.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the NotebookRuntime.
---@field description? string The description of the NotebookRuntime.
---@field notebookRuntimeTemplateRef? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeTemplateRef Output only. The pointer to NotebookRuntimeTemplate this NotebookRuntime is created from.
---@field softwareConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookSoftwareConfig Output only. Software config of the notebook runtime.
---@field runtimeState? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeRuntimeStateEnum|string Output only. The runtime (instance) state of the NotebookRuntime.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the NotebookRuntime. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters.
---@field expirationTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this NotebookRuntime will be expired: 1. System Predefined NotebookRuntime: 24 hours after creation. After expiration, system predifined runtime will be deleted. 2. User created NotebookRuntime: 6 months after last upgrade. After expiration, user created runtime will be stopped and allowed for upgrade.
---@field shieldedVmConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ShieldedVmConfig Output only. Runtime Shielded VM spec.
---@field notebookRuntimeType? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeNotebookRuntimeTypeEnum|string Output only. The type of the notebook runtime.
---@field machineSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1MachineSpec Output only. The specification of a single machine used by the notebook runtime.
---@field runtimeUser? string Required. The user email of the NotebookRuntime.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field eucConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookEucConfig Output only. EUC configuration of the notebook runtime.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this NotebookRuntime was most recently updated.
---@field proxyUri? string Output only. The proxy endpoint used to access the NotebookRuntime.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EncryptionSpec Output only. Customer-managed encryption key spec for the notebook runtime.
---@field healthState? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeHealthStateEnum|string Output only. The health state of the NotebookRuntime.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeHealthStateEnum "HEALTH_STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"HEALTHY"|"UNHEALTHY"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntime[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeNotebookRuntimeTypeEnum "NOTEBOOK_RUNTIME_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"USER_DEFINED"|"ONE_CLICK"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeRuntimeStateEnum "RUNTIME_STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"RUNNING"|"BEING_STARTED"|"BEING_STOPPED"|"STOPPED"|"BEING_UPGRADED"|"ERROR"|"INVALID"

---A template that specifies runtime configurations such as machine type, runtime version, network configurations, etc. Multiple runtimes can be created from a runtime template.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeTemplate
---@field isDefault? boolean Output only. Deprecated: This field has no behavior. Use notebook_runtime_type = 'ONE_CLICK' instead. The default template to use if not specified.
---@field eucConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookEucConfig EUC configuration of the NotebookRuntimeTemplate.
---@field softwareConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookSoftwareConfig Optional. The notebook software configuration of the notebook runtime.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to organize the NotebookRuntimeTemplates. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels.
---@field dataPersistentDiskSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PersistentDiskSpec Optional. The specification of persistent disk attached to the runtime as data disk storage.
---@field machineSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1MachineSpec Optional. Immutable. The specification of a single machine for the template.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EncryptionSpec Customer-managed encryption key spec for the notebook runtime.
---@field networkSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NetworkSpec Optional. Network spec.
---@field networkTags? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Optional. The Compute Engine tags to add to runtime (see [Tagging instances](https://cloud.google.com/vpc/docs/add-remove-network-tags)).
---@field shieldedVmConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ShieldedVmConfig Optional. Immutable. Runtime Shielded VM spec.
---@field etag? string Used to perform consistent read-modify-write updates. If not set, a blind "overwrite" update happens.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this NotebookRuntimeTemplate was created.
---@field description? string The description of the NotebookRuntimeTemplate.
---@field reservationAffinity? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookReservationAffinity Optional. Reservation Affinity of the notebook runtime template.
---@field name? string The resource name of the NotebookRuntimeTemplate.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this NotebookRuntimeTemplate was most recently updated.
---@field serviceAccount? string Deprecated: This field is ignored and the "Vertex AI Notebook Service Account" (service-PROJECT_NUMBER@gcp-sa-aiplatform-vm.iam.gserviceaccount.com) is used for the runtime workload identity. See https://cloud.google.com/iam/docs/service-agents#vertex-ai-notebook-service-account for more details. For NotebookExecutionJob, use NotebookExecutionJob.service_account instead. The service account that the runtime workload runs as. You can use any service account within the same project, but you must have the service account user permission to use the instance. If not specified, the [Compute Engine default service account](https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/access/service-accounts#default_service_account) is used.
---@field notebookRuntimeType? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeTemplateNotebookRuntimeTypeEnum Optional. Immutable. The type of the notebook runtime template.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the NotebookRuntimeTemplate. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters.
---@field idleShutdownConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookIdleShutdownConfig The idle shutdown configuration of NotebookRuntimeTemplate. This config will only be set when idle shutdown is enabled.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeTemplateList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeTemplate[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeTemplateNotebookRuntimeTypeEnum "NOTEBOOK_RUNTIME_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"USER_DEFINED"|"ONE_CLICK"

---Points to a NotebookRuntimeTemplateRef.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookRuntimeTemplateRef
---@field notebookRuntimeTemplate? string Immutable. A resource name of the NotebookRuntimeTemplate.

---Notebook Software Config. This is passed to the backend when user makes software configurations in UI.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NotebookSoftwareConfig
---@field postStartupScriptConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PostStartupScriptConfig Optional. Post startup script config.
---@field colabImage? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ColabImage Optional. Google-managed NotebookRuntime colab image.
---@field env? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EnvVarList Optional. Environment variables to be passed to the container. Maximum limit is 100.

---Observability settings for one agent's sessions.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ObservabilityConfig
---@field observabilityEnabled? boolean Optional. Enables observability for this agent's sessions: OpenTelemetry span emission covering tool names, model names, token counts, latencies and status. If `false`, the other fields here are ignored.
---@field sensitiveLoggingEnabled? boolean Optional. Enables sensitive logging. Sensitive logging includes customer core content (prompts, model completions, tool argument payloads and tool responses). If `false`, those are sanitized and only structural attributes are recorded. No effect unless `observability_enabled` is true. Settable and returned, but NOT YET ENFORCED. Nothing reads it at runtime, so `true` does not currently cause content to be captured, and `false` is not what keeps content from being captured. Treat it as a recorded intention that takes effect when enforcement lands.

---A one-off (single) run trigger.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OneOffSchedule
---@field runAt? string Absolute time to run at (e.g. 8 PM today).
---@field delay? string Relative delay before the single run.

---An OnlineEvaluator contains the configuration for an Online Evaluation.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluator
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when the OnlineEvaluator was created.
---@field displayName? string Optional. Human-readable name for the OnlineEvaluator. The name doesn't have to be unique. The name can consist of any UTF-8 characters. The maximum length is `63` characters. If the display name exceeds max characters, an `INVALID_ARGUMENT` error is returned.
---@field cloudObservability? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservability Data source for the OnlineEvaluator, based on Google Cloud Observability stack (Cloud Trace & Cloud Logging).
---@field agentResource? string Required. Immutable. The name of the agent that the OnlineEvaluator evaluates periodically. This value is used to filter the traces with a matching cloud.resource_id and link the evaluation results with relevant dashboards/UIs. This field is immutable. Once set, it cannot be changed.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorStateEnum Output only. The state of the OnlineEvaluator.
---@field metricSources? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1MetricSourceList Required. A list of metric sources to be used for evaluating samples. At least one MetricSource must be provided. Right now, only predefined metrics and registered metrics are supported. Every registered metric must have `display_name` (or `title`) and `score_range` defined. Otherwise, the evaluations will fail. The maximum number of `metric_sources` is 25.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when the OnlineEvaluator was last updated.
---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the OnlineEvaluator. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/onlineEvaluators/{id}.
---@field config? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorConfig Required. Configuration for the OnlineEvaluator.
---@field stateDetails? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorStateDetailsList Output only. Contains additional information about the state of the OnlineEvaluator. This is used to provide more details in the event of a failure.

---Data source for the OnlineEvaluator, based on Google Cloud Observability stack (Cloud Trace & Cloud Logging).
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservability
---@field logView? string Optional. Optional log view that will be used to query logs. If empty, the project's default view (`projects/{project_id}`) will be used.
---@field traceView? string Optional. Optional trace view that will be used to query traces. If empty, the `_AllSpans` view from `_Trace` US bucket will be used, i.e. `projects/{project_id}/locations/us/buckets/_Trace/datasets/Spans/views/_AllSpans`.
---@field openTelemetry? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityOpenTelemetry Data source follows OpenTelemetry convention.
---@field sessionScope? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilitySessionScope Scope online evaluation to OTel sessions (i.e. group of traces with the same conversation ID).
---@field traceScope? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityTraceScope Scope online evaluation to single traces.

---Defines a predicate for filtering based on a numeric value.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicate
---@field comparisonOperator? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicateComparisonOperatorEnum|string Required. The comparison operator to apply.
---@field value? number Required. The value to compare against.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicateComparisonOperatorEnum "COMPARISON_OPERATOR_UNSPECIFIED"|"LESS"|"LESS_OR_EQUAL"|"EQUAL"|"NOT_EQUAL"|"GREATER_OR_EQUAL"|"GREATER"

---Configuration for data source following OpenTelemetry.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityOpenTelemetry
---@field semconvVersion? string Required. Defines which version OTel Semantic Convention the data follows. Can be "1.39.0" or newer.

---If chosen, the online evaluator will evaluate sessions matching specified `filter`. A session is a group of traces with a common `gen_ai.conversation.id`.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilitySessionScope
---@field filter? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilitySessionScopePredicateList Optional. A list of predicates to filter sessions. Multiple predicates are combined using AND. The maximum number of predicates is 10.
---@field inactivityTrigger? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilitySessionScopeInactivityTrigger Session is considered ready for evaluation when there are no new traces for a specified period of inactivity.

---Configuration for inactivity based session completion.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilitySessionScopeInactivityTrigger
---@field threshold? string Required. The amount of time that must pass with no new traces before a session is considered ready for evaluation. This is a required field if InactivityTrigger is used. The value must be a positive duration no greater than 7 days (604800 seconds).

---Defines a single filter predicate.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilitySessionScopePredicate
---@field duration? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicate Filter on the duration of a session (in seconds).
---@field modelCalls? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicate Filter on the number of underlying LLM calls within a session.
---@field totalTokenUsage? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicate Filter on the total token usage within a session.
---@field serviceVersion? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityStringPredicate Filter on the versions that served a session (`service.version` OTel resource attribute); matches if any of them is listed. At most one is allowed. On Vertex AI Agent Engine, this is the runtime revision id, currently set only for agents created via v1beta1.
---@field toolCallErrors? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicate Filter on the number of tool call errors within a session.
---@field userTurns? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicate Filter on the number of user turns within a session.
---@field toolCalls? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicate Filter on the number of underlying tool calls within a session.
---@field modelCallErrors? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilityNumericPredicate Filter on the number of LLM call errors within a session.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilitySessionScopePredicateList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1OnlineEvaluatorCloudObservabilitySessionScopePredicate[]

