---Represents the spec of persistent disk and hyperdisk options.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PersistentDiskSpec
---@field diskSizeGb? string Size in GB of the disk (default is 100GB).
---@field diskType? string Type of the disk (default is "pd-standard"). Valid values: "pd-ssd" (Persistent Disk Solid State Drive) "pd-standard" (Persistent Disk Hard Disk Drive) "pd-balanced" (Balanced Persistent Disk) "pd-extreme" (Extreme Persistent Disk) "hyperdisk-balanced" (Hyperdisk Balanced) "hyperdisk-extreme" (Hyperdisk Extreme) "hyperdisk-balanced-high-availability" (Hyperdisk Balanced High Availability) "hyperdisk-ml" (Hyperdisk ML) "hyperdisk-throughput" (Hyperdisk Throughput)

---Represents long-lasting resources that are dedicated to users to runs custom workloads. A PersistentResource can have multiple node pools and each node pool can have its own machine spec.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PersistentResource
---@field error? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. Only populated when persistent resource's state is `STOPPING` or `ERROR`.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Time when the PersistentResource was created.
---@field reservedIpRanges? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Optional. A list of names for the reserved IP ranges under the VPC network that can be used for this persistent resource. If set, we will deploy the persistent resource within the provided IP ranges. Otherwise, the persistent resource is deployed to any IP ranges under the provided VPC network. Example: ['vertex-ai-ip-range'].
---@field startTime? string Output only. Time when the PersistentResource for the first time entered the `RUNNING` state.
---@field resourcePools? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ResourcePoolList Required. The spec of the pools of different resources.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap Optional. The labels with user-defined metadata to organize PersistentResource. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Time when the PersistentResource was most recently updated.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field displayName? string Optional. The display name of the PersistentResource. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PersistentResourceStateEnum Output only. The detailed state of a Study.
---@field network? string Optional. The full name of the Compute Engine [network](/compute/docs/networks-and-firewalls#networks) to peered with Vertex AI to host the persistent resources. For example, `projects/12345/global/networks/myVPC`. [Format](/compute/docs/reference/rest/v1/networks/insert) is of the form `projects/{project}/global/networks/{network}`. Where {project} is a project number, as in `12345`, and {network} is a network name. To specify this field, you must have already [configured VPC Network Peering for Vertex AI](https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/general/vpc-peering). If this field is left unspecified, the resources aren't peered with any network.
---@field pscInterfaceConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PscInterfaceConfig Optional. Configuration for PSC-I for PersistentResource.
---@field resourceRuntimeSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ResourceRuntimeSpec Optional. Persistent Resource runtime spec. For example, used for Ray cluster configuration.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EncryptionSpec Optional. Customer-managed encryption key spec for a PersistentResource. If set, this PersistentResource and all sub-resources of this PersistentResource will be secured by this key.
---@field resourceRuntime? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ResourceRuntime Output only. Runtime information of the Persistent Resource.
---@field name? string Immutable. Resource name of a PersistentResource.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PersistentResourceList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PersistentResource[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PersistentResourceStateEnum "STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"PROVISIONING"|"RUNNING"|"STOPPING"|"ERROR"|"REBOOTING"|"UPDATING"

---The persona (presentation) of an agent.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Persona
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the agent.
---@field role? string Optional. The role of the agent (e.g., "Financial Analyst").
---@field avatarUrl? string Optional. The URL of the agent's avatar.
---@field personality? string Optional. The personality style or behavioral trait of the agent.

---An instance of a machine learning PipelineJob.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJob
---@field runtimeConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfig Runtime config of the pipeline.
---@field jobDetail? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobDetail Output only. The details of pipeline run. Not available in the list view.
---@field pipelineSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DocumentMap A compiled definition of a pipeline, represented as a `JSON` object. Defines the structure of the pipeline, including its components, tasks, and parameters. This specification is generated by compiling a pipeline function defined in `Python` using the `Kubeflow Pipelines SDK`.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EncryptionSpec Customer-managed encryption key spec for a pipelineJob. If set, this PipelineJob and all of its sub-resources will be secured by this key.
---@field scheduleName? string Output only. The schedule resource name. Only returned if the Pipeline is created by Schedule API.
---@field reservedIpRanges? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList A list of names for the reserved ip ranges under the VPC network that can be used for this Pipeline Job's workload. If set, we will deploy the Pipeline Job's workload within the provided ip ranges. Otherwise, the job will be deployed to any ip ranges under the provided VPC network. Example: ['vertex-ai-ip-range'].
---@field startTime? string Output only. Pipeline start time.
---@field endTime? string Output only. Pipeline end time.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the PipelineJob.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Pipeline creation time.
---@field pipelineTaskRerunConfigs? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskRerunConfigList Optional. The rerun configs for each task in the pipeline job. By default, the rerun will: 1. Use the same input artifacts as the original run. 2. Use the same input parameters as the original run. 3. Skip all the tasks that are already succeeded in the original run. 4. Rerun all the tasks that are not succeeded in the original run. By providing this field, users can override the default behavior and specify the rerun config for each task.
---@field originalPipelineJobId? string Optional. The original pipeline job id if this pipeline job is a rerun of a previous pipeline job.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap The labels with user-defined metadata to organize PipelineJob. Label keys and values can be no longer than 64 characters (Unicode codepoints), can only contain lowercase letters, numeric characters, underscores and dashes. International characters are allowed. See https://goo.gl/xmQnxf for more information and examples of labels. Note there is some reserved label key for Vertex AI Pipelines. - `vertex-ai-pipelines-run-billing-id`, user set value will get overrided.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field pscInterfaceConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PscInterfaceConfig Optional. Configuration for PSC-I for PipelineJob.
---@field templateMetadata? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTemplateMetadata Output only. Pipeline template metadata. Will fill up fields if PipelineJob.template_uri is from supported template registry.
---@field error? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. The error that occurred during pipeline execution. Only populated when the pipeline's state is FAILED or CANCELLED.
---@field displayName? string The display name of the Pipeline. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this PipelineJob was most recently updated.
---@field serviceAccount? string The service account that the pipeline workload runs as. If not specified, the Compute Engine default service account in the project will be used. See https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/access/service-accounts#default_service_account Users starting the pipeline must have the `iam.serviceAccounts.actAs` permission on this service account.
---@field templateUri? string A template uri from where the PipelineJob.pipeline_spec, if empty, will be downloaded. Currently, only uri from Vertex Template Registry & Gallery is supported. Reference to https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/pipelines/create-pipeline-template.
---@field preflightValidations? boolean Optional. Whether to do component level validations before job creation.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobStateEnum|string Output only. The detailed state of the job.
---@field network? string The full name of the Compute Engine [network](/compute/docs/networks-and-firewalls#networks) to which the Pipeline Job's workload should be peered. For example, `projects/12345/global/networks/myVPC`. [Format](/compute/docs/reference/rest/v1/networks/insert) is of the form `projects/{project}/global/networks/{network}`. Where {project} is a project number, as in `12345`, and {network} is a network name. Private services access must already be configured for the network. Pipeline job will apply the network configuration to the Google Cloud resources being launched, if applied, such as Vertex AI Training or Dataflow job. If left unspecified, the workload is not peered with any network.

---The runtime detail of PipelineJob.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobDetail
---@field pipelineRunContext? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Context Output only. The context of the current pipeline run.
---@field taskDetails? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailList Output only. The runtime details of the tasks under the pipeline.
---@field pipelineContext? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Context Output only. The context of the pipeline.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJob[]

---The runtime config of a PipelineJob.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfig
---@field failurePolicy? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigFailurePolicyEnum|string Represents the failure policy of a pipeline. Currently, the default of a pipeline is that the pipeline will continue to run until no more tasks can be executed, also known as PIPELINE_FAILURE_POLICY_FAIL_SLOW. However, if a pipeline is set to PIPELINE_FAILURE_POLICY_FAIL_FAST, it will stop scheduling any new tasks when a task has failed. Any scheduled tasks will continue to completion.
---@field parameterValues? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DocumentMap The runtime parameters of the PipelineJob. The parameters will be passed into PipelineJob.pipeline_spec to replace the placeholders at runtime. This field is used by pipelines built using `PipelineJob.pipeline_spec.schema_version` 2.1.0, such as pipelines built using Kubeflow Pipelines SDK 1.9 or higher and the v2 DSL.
---@field defaultRuntime? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigDefaultRuntime Optional. The default runtime for the PipelineJob. If not set, Standard Vertex Custom Job(https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/training/overview) is used as the runtime. If set, all pipeline tasks will run on the default runtime unless a task is a GCPC custom job component (https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/pipelines/customjob-component) based task. If the task is based on a GCPC custom job component, it runs solely according to the component's configuration.
---@field inputArtifacts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigInputArtifactMap The runtime artifacts of the PipelineJob. The key will be the input artifact name and the value would be one of the InputArtifact.
---@field gcsOutputDirectory? string Required. A path in a Cloud Storage bucket, which will be treated as the root output directory of the pipeline. It is used by the system to generate the paths of output artifacts. The artifact paths are generated with a sub-path pattern `{job_id}/{task_id}/{output_key}` under the specified output directory. The service account specified in this pipeline must have the `storage.objects.get` and `storage.objects.create` permissions for this bucket.
---@field parameters? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ValueMap Deprecated. Use RuntimeConfig.parameter_values instead. The runtime parameters of the PipelineJob. The parameters will be passed into PipelineJob.pipeline_spec to replace the placeholders at runtime. This field is used by pipelines built using `PipelineJob.pipeline_spec.schema_version` 2.0.0 or lower, such as pipelines built using Kubeflow Pipelines SDK 1.8 or lower.

---The default runtime for the PipelineJob.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigDefaultRuntime
---@field persistentResourceRuntimeDetail? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigPersistentResourceRuntimeDetail Persistent resource based runtime detail.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigFailurePolicyEnum "PIPELINE_FAILURE_POLICY_UNSPECIFIED"|"PIPELINE_FAILURE_POLICY_FAIL_SLOW"|"PIPELINE_FAILURE_POLICY_FAIL_FAST"

---The type of an input artifact.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigInputArtifact
---@field artifactId? string Artifact resource id from MLMD. Which is the last portion of an artifact resource name: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/metadataStores/default/artifacts/{artifact_id}`. The artifact must stay within the same project, location and default metadatastore as the pipeline.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigInputArtifactMap { [string]: gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigInputArtifact }

---Persistent resource based runtime detail. For more information about persistent resource, refer to https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/training/persistent-resource-overview
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigPersistentResourceRuntimeDetail
---@field taskResourceUnavailableWaitTimeMs? string The max time a pipeline task waits for the required CPU, memory, or accelerator resource to become available from the specified persistent resource. Default wait time is 0.
---@field taskResourceUnavailableTimeoutBehavior? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigPersistentResourceRuntimeDetailTaskResourceUnavailableTimeoutBehaviorEnum|string Specifies the behavior to take if the timeout is reached.
---@field persistentResourceName? string Persistent resource name. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/persistentResources/{persistent_resource}`

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobRuntimeConfigPersistentResourceRuntimeDetailTaskResourceUnavailableTimeoutBehaviorEnum "TASK_RESOURCE_UNAVAILABLE_TIMEOUT_BEHAVIOR_UNSPECIFIED"|"FAIL"|"FALL_BACK_TO_ON_DEMAND"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineJobStateEnum "PIPELINE_STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"PIPELINE_STATE_QUEUED"|"PIPELINE_STATE_PENDING"|"PIPELINE_STATE_RUNNING"|"PIPELINE_STATE_SUCCEEDED"|"PIPELINE_STATE_FAILED"|"PIPELINE_STATE_CANCELLING"|"PIPELINE_STATE_CANCELLED"|"PIPELINE_STATE_PAUSED"

---The runtime detail of a task execution.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetail
---@field executorDetail? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskExecutorDetail Output only. The detailed execution info.
---@field inputs? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailArtifactListMap Output only. The runtime input artifacts of the task.
---@field taskId? string Output only. The system generated ID of the task.
---@field parentTaskId? string Output only. The id of the parent task if the task is within a component scope. Empty if the task is at the root level.
---@field taskUniqueName? string Output only. The unique name of a task. This field is used by rerun pipeline job. Console UI and Vertex AI SDK will support triggering pipeline job reruns. The name is constructed by concatenating all the parent tasks name with the task name. For example, if a task named "child_task" has a parent task named "parent_task_1" and parent task 1 has a parent task named "parent_task_2", the task unique name will be "parent_task_2.parent_task_1.child_task".
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailStateEnum|string Output only. State of the task.
---@field taskName? string Output only. The user specified name of the task that is defined in pipeline_spec.
---@field outputs? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailArtifactListMap Output only. The runtime output artifacts of the task.
---@field startTime? string Output only. Task start time.
---@field error? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. The error that occurred during task execution. Only populated when the task's state is FAILED or CANCELLED.
---@field endTime? string Output only. Task end time.
---@field pipelineTaskStatus? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailPipelineTaskStatusList Output only. A list of task status. This field keeps a record of task status evolving over time.
---@field execution? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Execution Output only. The execution metadata of the task.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Task create time.

---A list of artifact metadata.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailArtifactList
---@field artifacts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ArtifactList Output only. A list of artifact metadata.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailArtifactListMap { [string]: gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailArtifactList }

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetail[]

---A single record of the task status.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailPipelineTaskStatus
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailPipelineTaskStatusStateEnum|string Output only. The state of the task.
---@field error? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. The error that occurred during the state. May be set when the state is any of the non-final state (PENDING/RUNNING/CANCELLING) or FAILED state. If the state is FAILED, the error here is final and not going to be retried. If the state is a non-final state, the error indicates a system-error being retried.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Update time of this status.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailPipelineTaskStatusList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailPipelineTaskStatus[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailPipelineTaskStatusStateEnum "STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"PENDING"|"RUNNING"|"SUCCEEDED"|"CANCEL_PENDING"|"CANCELLING"|"CANCELLED"|"FAILED"|"SKIPPED"|"NOT_TRIGGERED"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskDetailStateEnum "STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"PENDING"|"RUNNING"|"SUCCEEDED"|"CANCEL_PENDING"|"CANCELLING"|"CANCELLED"|"FAILED"|"SKIPPED"|"NOT_TRIGGERED"

---The runtime detail of a pipeline executor.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskExecutorDetail
---@field containerDetail? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskExecutorDetailContainerDetail Output only. The detailed info for a container executor.
---@field customJobDetail? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskExecutorDetailCustomJobDetail Output only. The detailed info for a custom job executor.

---The detail of a container execution. It contains the job names of the lifecycle of a container execution.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskExecutorDetailContainerDetail
---@field preCachingCheckJob? string Output only. The name of the CustomJob for the pre-caching-check container execution. This job will be available if the PipelineJob.pipeline_spec specifies the `pre_caching_check` hook in the lifecycle events.
---@field failedPreCachingCheckJobs? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Output only. The names of the previously failed CustomJob for the pre-caching-check container executions. This job will be available if the PipelineJob.pipeline_spec specifies the `pre_caching_check` hook in the lifecycle events. The list includes the all attempts in chronological order.
---@field mainJob? string Output only. The name of the CustomJob for the main container execution.
---@field failedMainJobs? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Output only. The names of the previously failed CustomJob for the main container executions. The list includes the all attempts in chronological order.

