---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskExecutorDetailCustomJobDetail
---@field job? string Output only. The name of the CustomJob.
---@field failedJobs? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Output only. The names of the previously failed CustomJob. The list includes the all attempts in chronological order.

---User provided rerun config to submit a rerun pipelinejob. This includes 1. Which task to rerun 2. User override input parameters and artifacts.
