---Runtime inputs data of the task.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskRerunConfigInputs
---@field artifacts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskRerunConfigArtifactListMap Optional. Input artifacts.
---@field parameterValues? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DocumentMap Optional. Input parameters.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskRerunConfigList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PipelineTaskRerunConfig[]

---Pipeline template metadata if PipelineJob.template_uri is from supported template registry. Currently, the only supported registry is Artifact Registry.
