---Relevant contexts for one query.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagContexts
---@field contexts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagContextsContextList All its contexts.

---A context of the query.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagContextsContext
---@field text? string The text chunk.
---@field distance? number The distance between the query dense embedding vector and the context text vector.
---@field sparseDistance? number The distance between the query sparse embedding vector and the context text vector.
---@field score? number According to the underlying Vector DB and the selected metric type, the score can be either the distance or the similarity between the query and the context and its range depends on the metric type. For example, if the metric type is COSINE_DISTANCE, it represents the distance between the query and the context. The larger the distance, the less relevant the context is to the query. The range is [0, 2], while 0 means the most relevant and 2 means the least relevant.
---@field chunk? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagChunk Context of the retrieved chunk.
---@field sourceUri? string If the file is imported from Cloud Storage or Google Drive, source_uri will be original file URI in Cloud Storage or Google Drive; if file is uploaded, source_uri will be file display name.
---@field sourceDisplayName? string The file display name.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagContextsContextList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagContextsContext[]

---A RagCorpus is a RagFile container and a project can have multiple RagCorpora.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagCorpus
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this RagCorpus was created.
---@field vertexAiSearchConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1VertexAiSearchConfig Optional. Immutable. The config for the Vertex AI Search.
---@field corpusTypeConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagCorpusCorpusTypeConfig Optional. The corpus type config of the RagCorpus.
---@field description? string Optional. The description of the RagCorpus.
---@field corpusStatus? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1CorpusStatus Output only. RagCorpus state.
---@field ragFilesCount? number Output only. Number of RagFiles in the RagCorpus. NOTE: This field is not populated in the response of VertexRagDataService.ListRagCorpora.
---@field satisfiesPzi? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field encryptionSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EncryptionSpec Optional. Immutable. The CMEK key name used to encrypt at-rest data related to this Corpus. Only applicable to RagManagedDb option for Vector DB. This field can only be set at corpus creation time, and cannot be updated or deleted.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the RagCorpus. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this RagCorpus was last updated.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the RagCorpus.
---@field satisfiesPzs? boolean Output only. Reserved for future use.
---@field ragVectorDbConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagVectorDbConfig Optional. Immutable. The Vector DB config of the RagCorpus.
---@field vectorDbConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagVectorDbConfig Optional. Immutable. The config for the Vector DBs.
---@field ragEmbeddingModelConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagEmbeddingModelConfig Optional. Immutable. The embedding model config of the RagCorpus.

