---@field ragManagedDbConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagManagedDbConfig The config of the RagManagedDb used by RagEngine.

---A RagFile contains user data for chunking, embedding and indexing.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagFile
---@field description? string Optional. The description of the RagFile.
---@field gcsSource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GcsSource Output only. Google Cloud Storage location of the RagFile. It does not support wildcards in the Cloud Storage uri for now.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the RagFile. The name can be up to 128 characters long and can consist of any UTF-8 characters.
---@field directUploadSource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1DirectUploadSource Output only. The RagFile is encapsulated and uploaded in the UploadRagFile request.
---@field slackSource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SlackSource The RagFile is imported from a Slack channel.
---@field googleDriveSource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GoogleDriveSource Output only. Google Drive location. Supports importing individual files as well as Google Drive folders.
---@field ragFileType? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1RagFileRagFileTypeEnum Output only. The type of the RagFile.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this RagFile was created.
---@field userMetadata? string Output only. The metadata for metadata search. The user_metadata Needs to be in JSON format.
---@field sharePointSources? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SharePointSources The RagFile is imported from a SharePoint source.
---@field jiraSource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1JiraSource The RagFile is imported from a Jira query.
---@field fileStatus? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FileStatus Output only. State of the RagFile.
---@field sizeBytes? string Output only. The size of the RagFile in bytes.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the RagFile.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this RagFile was last updated.

