---@field autoscalingSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ResourcePoolAutoscalingSpec Optional. Optional spec to configure GKE or Ray-on-Vertex autoscaling
---@field replicaCount? string Optional. The total number of machines to use for this resource pool.
