---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyInstance
---@field prediction? string Required. Output of the evaluated model.

---A safety rating for a piece of content. The safety rating contains the harm category and the harm probability level.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRating
---@field blocked? boolean Output only. Indicates whether the content was blocked because of this rating.
---@field category? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRatingCategoryEnum Output only. The harm category of this rating.
---@field probability? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRatingProbabilityEnum Output only. The probability of harm for this category.
---@field overwrittenThreshold? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRatingOverwrittenThresholdEnum Output only. The overwritten threshold for the safety category of Gemini 2.0 image out. If minors are detected in the output image, the threshold of each safety category will be overwritten if user sets a lower threshold.
---@field probabilityScore? number Output only. The probability score of harm for this category.
---@field severity? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRatingSeverityEnum Output only. The severity of harm for this category.
---@field severityScore? number Output only. The severity score of harm for this category.

