---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRatingList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRating[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRatingOverwrittenThresholdEnum "HARM_BLOCK_THRESHOLD_UNSPECIFIED"|"BLOCK_LOW_AND_ABOVE"|"BLOCK_MEDIUM_AND_ABOVE"|"BLOCK_ONLY_HIGH"|"BLOCK_NONE"|"OFF"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRatingProbabilityEnum "HARM_PROBABILITY_UNSPECIFIED"|"NEGLIGIBLE"|"LOW"|"MEDIUM"|"HIGH"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyRatingSeverityEnum "HARM_SEVERITY_UNSPECIFIED"|"HARM_SEVERITY_NEGLIGIBLE"|"HARM_SEVERITY_LOW"|"HARM_SEVERITY_MEDIUM"|"HARM_SEVERITY_HIGH"

---Spec for safety result.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetyResult
---@field score? number Output only. Safety score.
---@field confidence? number Output only. Confidence for safety score.
---@field explanation? string Output only. Explanation for safety score.

---A safety setting that affects the safety-blocking behavior. A SafetySetting consists of a harm category and a threshold for that category.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySetting
---@field category? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySettingCategoryEnum|string Required. The harm category to be blocked.
---@field threshold? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySettingThresholdEnum|string Required. The threshold for blocking content. If the harm probability exceeds this threshold, the content will be blocked.
---@field method? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySettingMethodEnum|string Optional. The method for blocking content. If not specified, the default behavior is to use the probability score.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySettingCategoryEnum "HARM_CATEGORY_UNSPECIFIED"|"HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH"|"HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT"|"HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT"|"HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT"|"HARM_CATEGORY_CIVIC_INTEGRITY"|"HARM_CATEGORY_IMAGE_HATE"|"HARM_CATEGORY_IMAGE_DANGEROUS_CONTENT"|"HARM_CATEGORY_IMAGE_HARASSMENT"|"HARM_CATEGORY_IMAGE_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT"|"HARM_CATEGORY_JAILBREAK"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySettingList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySetting[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySettingMethodEnum "HARM_BLOCK_METHOD_UNSPECIFIED"|"SEVERITY"|"PROBABILITY"

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySettingThresholdEnum "HARM_BLOCK_THRESHOLD_UNSPECIFIED"|"BLOCK_LOW_AND_ABOVE"|"BLOCK_MEDIUM_AND_ABOVE"|"BLOCK_ONLY_HIGH"|"BLOCK_NONE"|"OFF"

---Spec for safety metric.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SafetySpec
---@field version? number Optional. Which version to use for evaluation.

---Active learning data sampling config. For every active learning labeling iteration, it will select a batch of data based on the sampling strategy.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SampleConfig
---@field initialBatchSamplePercentage? number The percentage of data needed to be labeled in the first batch.
---@field followingBatchSamplePercentage? number The percentage of data needed to be labeled in each following batch (except the first batch).
---@field sampleStrategy? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SampleConfigSampleStrategyEnum|string Field to choose sampling strategy. Sampling strategy will decide which data should be selected for human labeling in every batch.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SampleConfigSampleStrategyEnum "SAMPLE_STRATEGY_UNSPECIFIED"|"UNCERTAINTY"

---An attribution method that approximates Shapley values for features that contribute to the label being predicted. A sampling strategy is used to approximate the value rather than considering all subsets of features.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SampledShapleyAttribution
---@field pathCount? number Required. The number of feature permutations to consider when approximating the Shapley values. Valid range of its value is [1, 50], inclusively.

---Sampling Strategy for logging, can be for both training and prediction dataset.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SamplingStrategy
---@field randomSampleConfig? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SamplingStrategyRandomSampleConfig Random sample config. Will support more sampling strategies later.

---Requests are randomly selected.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SamplingStrategyRandomSampleConfig
---@field sampleRate? number Sample rate (0, 1]

---SandboxEnvironment is a containerized environment that provides a customizable secure execution runtime for AI agents.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironment
---@field name? string Identifier. The name of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@field sandboxEnvironmentTemplate? string Optional. The name of the SandboxEnvironmentTemplate specified in the parent Agent Engine resource that this SandboxEnvironment is created from.
---@field latestSandboxEnvironmentSnapshot? string Output only. The resource name of the latest snapshot taken for this SandboxEnvironment.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironment was most recently updated.
---@field sandboxEnvironmentSnapshot? string Optional. The resource name of the SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot to use for creating this SandboxEnvironment. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/reasoningEngines/{reasoning_engine}/sandboxEnvironmentSnapshots/{sandbox_environment_snapshot}`
---@field expireTime? string Optional. Timestamp in UTC of when this SandboxEnvironment is considered expired. This is *always* provided on output, regardless of what `expiration` was sent on input.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentStateEnum Output only. The runtime state of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@field owner? string Optional. Owner information for this sandbox environment. A Sandbox can only be restored from a snapshot that belongs to the same owner. If not set, sandbox will be created as the default owner.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironment was created.
---@field connectionInfo? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentConnectionInfo Output only. The connection information of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@field spec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentSpec Optional. The configuration of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@field ttl? string Optional. Input only. The TTL for the sandbox environment. The expiration time is computed: now + TTL.

---The connection information of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentConnectionInfo
---@field serviceAttachment? string Output only. The name of the PSC-E service attachment created for private ingress to this SandboxEnvironment. Only populated when the template enables private ingress (see SandboxEnvironmentTemplate.ingress_control_config). VPC-SC customers use this to create a PSC endpoint in their VPC.
---@field routingToken? string Output only. The routing token for the SandboxEnvironment.
---@field loadBalancerIp? string Output only. The IP address of the load balancer.
---@field loadBalancerHostname? string Output only. The hostname of the load balancer.
---@field sandboxInternalIp? string Output only. The internal IP address of the SandboxEnvironment.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironment[]

---SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot is a snapshot of the SandboxEnvironment.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot
---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/reasoningEngines/{reasoning_engine}/sandboxEnvironmentSnapshots/{sandbox_environment_snapshot}`
---@field postSnapshotAction? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentSnapshotPostSnapshotActionEnum Optional. Input only. Action to take on the source SandboxEnvironment after the snapshot is taken. This field is only used in CreateSandboxEnvironmentSnapshotRequest and it is not stored in the resource.
---@field owner? string Optional. Owner information for this sandbox snapshot. Different owners will have isolations on snapshot storage and identity. If not set, snapshot will be created as the default owner.
---@field sizeBytes? string Optional. Output only. Size of the snapshot data in bytes.
---@field expireTime? string Optional. Timestamp in UTC of when this SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot is considered expired. This is *always* provided on output, regardless of what `expiration` was sent on input.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironment was most recently updated.
---@field useGkeTd? boolean Output only. Whether the source SandboxEnvironment uses the GKE TD pool.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot was created.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot.
---@field ttl? string Optional. Input only. The TTL for the sandbox environment snapshot. The expiration time is computed: now + TTL.
---@field sourceSandboxEnvironment? string Required. The resource name of the source SandboxEnvironment this snapshot was taken from.
---@field parentSnapshot? string Output only. The resource name of the parent SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot. Empty if this is a root Snapshot (the first snapshot from a newly created sandbox). Can be used to reconstruct the whole ancestry tree of snapshots.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentSnapshotList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentSnapshot[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentSnapshotPostSnapshotActionEnum "POST_SNAPSHOT_ACTION_UNSPECIFIED"|"RUNNING"|"PAUSE"

