---@field useGkeTd? boolean Optional. Immutable. Whether to provision the SandboxEnvironment via the GKE TD pool. Immutable.
---@field computerUseEnvironment? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentSpecComputerUseEnvironment Optional. The computer use environment.
---@field shellEnvironment? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SandboxEnvironmentSpecShellEnvironment Optional. The shell environment for executing shell commands and scripts.

