---A segment of the content.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Segment
---@field partIndex? number Output only. The index of the `Part` object that this segment belongs to. This is useful for associating the segment with a specific part of the content.
---@field startIndex? number Output only. The start index of the segment in the `Part`, measured in bytes. This marks the beginning of the segment and is inclusive, meaning the byte at this index is the first byte of the segment.
---@field text? string Output only. The text of the segment.
---@field endIndex? number Output only. The end index of the segment in the `Part`, measured in bytes. This marks the end of the segment and is exclusive, meaning the segment includes content up to, but not including, the byte at this index.

---Represents a governance policy applied to a specific Agent and optionally a specific Tool within that Agent.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SemanticGovernancePolicy
---@field naturalLanguageConstraint? string Required. The natural language constraint of the SemanticGovernancePolicy.
---@field mcpTools? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SemanticGovernancePolicyMcpToolList Optional. The McpTools that are affected by this policy.
---@field agentResponseCustomization? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1AgentResponseCustomization Optional. Settings for customizing the agent's response to end users when this policy is evaluated, such as messages displayed when the policy denies a request.
---@field description? string Optional. The description of the SemanticGovernancePolicy.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this SemanticGovernancePolicy was last updated.
---@field etag? string Optional. Used to perform consistent read-modify-write transactions. If provided, the request will only succeed if the etag matches the current value. Otherwise, an ABORTED error will be returned.
---@field agent? string Required. The name of the agent in Agent Registry that is affected by this policy. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/agents/{agent}`
---@field dryRun? boolean Optional. If true, this policy is evaluated and its result is reported, but the policy is not enforced: a violation does not block the agent's action. Use this to validate a policy against real traffic before turning enforcement on. Defaults to `false`, meaning the policy is enforced. This setting applies only to this policy. If the SemanticGovernancePolicyEngine for the project is itself in dry run, every policy behaves as dry run regardless of this field.
---@field displayName? string Optional. The user-defined name of the SemanticGovernancePolicy.
---@field agentIdentity? string Output only. Represents the principal of the agent, used by the Policy Decision Point (PDP) for governance checks. For more information, see https://docs.cloud.google.com/agent-builder/agent-engine/agent-identity Format: `principal://TRUST_DOMAIN/NAMESPACE/AGENT_NAME` Example: `principal://agents.global.org-ORGANIZATION_ID.system.id.goog/resources/aiplatform/projects/PROJECT_NUMBER/locations/LOCATION/reasoningEngines/AGENT_ENGINE_ID`
---@field name? string Identifier. Resource name of the SemanticGovernancePolicy.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this SemanticGovernancePolicy was created.

---Define a singleton SemanticGovernancePolicyEngine resource under a project and location.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SemanticGovernancePolicyEngine
---@field ipAddress? string Output only. The private IPv4 address of the PSC endpoint.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this SemanticGovernancePolicyEngine was last updated.
---@field gatewayConfigs? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GatewayConfigMap Optional. Configurations for gateways. The keys are user-defined names for each gateway. At most 5 gateway configurations are allowed.
---@field pscForwardingRule? string Output only. The URI of the PSC endpoint resource created in customer project. Format: projects/{project}/regions/{region}/forwardingRules/{forwarding_rule}
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp when this SemanticGovernancePolicyEngine was created.
---@field pscServiceAttachment? string Output only. URI of the PSC attachment resource provided by SGP. Format: projects/{project}/regions/{region}/serviceAttachments/{service_attachment}
---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the SemanticGovernancePolicyEngine. Format: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/semanticGovernancePolicyEngine
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SemanticGovernancePolicyEngineStateEnum Output only. The state of the SemanticGovernancePolicyEngine.

