---@field pendingDataLabelingJobs? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Output only. The resource name of the pending data labeling jobs.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SpecialistPoolList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1SpecialistPool[]

