---@field doubleValueSpec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1StudySpecParameterSpecDoubleValueSpec The value spec for a 'DOUBLE' parameter.
---@field scaleType? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1StudySpecParameterSpecScaleTypeEnum|string How the parameter should be scaled. Leave unset for `CATEGORICAL` parameters.

---Value specification for a parameter in `CATEGORICAL` type.
