---A durable, addressable unit of work: scoped context + a goal with verifiers, assigned to an agent, and executed as a trajectory of steps. A Task is the resource users open, list, and manage. It is a light "header" (status, title, summary, outcome). The executed trajectory (steps) is not stored inline -- it is streamed live over CreateTaskBidiStream (fetched from the runtime), so a long-running/re-firing task carries no unbounded blob. Resource name (canonical): projects/{project}/locations/{location}/agents/{agent}/tasks/{task} Task is a sub-resource of Agent. A short alias projects/{project}/locations/{location}/tasks/{task} is also accepted (dual-path); the task id is unique within a project+location, so both forms resolve the same task. The short form is retained intentionally : * GetTask/ListTasks support both (dual) resource paths. * Subtasks store the short form in parent_task_id, so that reassignment of the parent task to another agent later will not require updating the subtasks, and the rendering of the task tree will not imply the agent relationships.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Task
---@field summary? string Output only. A rolling, system-generated summary of the task's progress/result.
---@field statusDetail? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskStatusDetail Output only. Explanation for the current state, when the state alone is not enough to act on (today: `SUSPENDED`). Cleared when the task leaves that state.
---@field scheduleState? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskScheduleStateEnum Output only. Scheduling lifecycle of a recurring template. Unset unless `spec.schedule.recurring` is set.
---@field status? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskStatusEnum Output only. The coarse, durable status of the task.
---@field rootTaskId? string Output only. Lineage group key: the root of this task's tree, materialized from `parent_task_id` (a root task's own short-form name). Same short form, and for the same reason, as `parent_task_id`. One `ListTasks(filter: "root_task_id=")` returns the whole tree as a flat, paginated collection, instead of a level-by-level walk that costs one round trip per depth. The client reassembles the tree from `parent_task_id`; a page may therefore contain a task whose parent lands on a later page.
---@field spec? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskSpec Required. The full specification of what to do, how to run it, and how to know it is done.
---@field budgetConsumptionDetail? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1BudgetConsumptionDetail Output only. Current budget consumption detail of the Task.
---@field assignedAgentIdentity? string Output only. The resolved Agent Identity (SPIFFE ID) of the `Agent` this task is assigned to. Populated on single-task RPCs (`CreateTask`, `GetTask`, `UpdateTask`, `SuspendTask`, `ResumeTask`, `CancelTask`); not populated by `ListTasks`.
---@field runCount? string Output only. Runs minted so far by a recurring template, so a client can show progress against `RecurringSchedule.max_run_count`.
---@field nextRunTime? string Output only. Next scheduled firing of a recurring template. Unset once the template is `SCHEDULE_FINISHED`, and for cron-less (event) schedules.
---@field goals? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GoalList Output only. Goals of the Task, including both active and completed/failed. A Task may pursue several concurrently active goals .
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time the task was created.
---@field assignedAgent? string Output only. The resource name of the `Agent` this task is assigned to, in the format `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/agents/{agent}`. It is derived from the create parent; any value set by the client is ignored.
---@field name? string Identifier. Resource name of the task.
---@field statusUpdateTime? string Output only. The time the task's status was last updated.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringMap Optional. Optional caller-supplied labels. Must follow the unified cloud labels spec (keys/values lowercase `[a-z0-9_-]`, <=63 chars). Stored as-is and returned verbatim on Get/ListTask, so the caller owns what goes in and reads back. Label names starting with `goog-` or `google-` are reserved for predefined labels. Besides user-defined billing/reporting labels, callers may stamp non-PII operational traffic annotations here under the reserved prefix (persisted on the task, so they apply to every turn and survive reconnection). Predefined: `goog-golden-query-id`: stable golden-query / CUJ id (e.g. `hello-world`); absent for organic traffic. Lets per-CUJ latency be trended independently.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The time the task was last updated.
---@field parentTaskId? string Optional. If this task is a subtask, the parent task's short-form, agent-independent resource name: projects/{project}/locations/{location}/tasks/{task} The short form is used here on purpose (NOT the agent-scoped .../agents/{agent}/tasks/{task}): it stays stable when the parent is reassigned to another agent, so subtasks never need rewriting, and the task tree does not imply agent relationships .
---@field title? string Optional. Optional human-readable title for listing surfaces.

---Represents a single artifact produced by a task. sample: artifacts: { artifact_id: "image-12345" name: "Generated Sunset Image" description: "A beautiful sunset over the mountains, generated by the user's request." parts: { inline_data: { mime_type: "image/png" data: "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAA=" } } }
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskArtifact
---@field parts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PartList Required. The content of the artifact.
---@field description? string Optional. A human readable description of the artifact.
---@field displayName? string Optional. The human-readable name of the artifact provided by the creator.
---@field artifactId? string Required. The unique identifier of the artifact within the task. This id is provided by the creator of the artifact.
---@field metadata? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DocumentMap Optional. Additional metadata for the artifact. For A2A, the URIs of the extensions that were used to produce this artifact will be stored here.

---Describes changes to the artifact list.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskArtifactChange
---@field addedArtifacts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskArtifactList Optional. A list of brand-new artifacts created in this event.
---@field updatedArtifacts? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskArtifactList Optional. A list of existing artifacts that were modified in this event.
---@field deletedArtifactIds? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList Optional. A list of artifact IDs that were removed in this event.

---A file or directory in a task's workspace.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskArtifactFile
---@field type? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskArtifactFileTypeEnum Output only. Whether this entry is a file or a directory.
---@field mimeType? string Output only. The detected media type. Empty for directories.
---@field path? string Output only. Absolute path in the task's sandbox, e.g. "/workspace/userdata/input.csv" or "/workspace/report.md". Always under "/workspace" and never contains "..". Can be passed as-is to DownloadTaskArtifact.
---@field sizeBytes? string Output only. Size of the file in bytes. Zero for directories.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Last modification time of the file as it was read: the sandbox's when read from a running sandbox, otherwise the stored object's.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskArtifactFileList gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskArtifactFile[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TaskArtifactFileTypeEnum "TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"FILE"|"DIRECTORY"

