---@field id? string Optional. The unique raw ID of the tenant.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TenantTypeEnum "TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"WORKSPACE_CUSTOMER"

---A tensor value type.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Tensor
---@field boolVal? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.BooleanList Type specific representations that make it easy to create tensor protos in all languages. Only the representation corresponding to "dtype" can be set. The values hold the flattened representation of the tensor in row major order. BOOL
---@field doubleVal? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DoubleList DOUBLE
---@field structVal? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TensorMap A map of string to tensor.
---@field bytesVal? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.StringList STRING
---@field uintVal? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.IntegerList UINT8 UINT16 UINT32
---@field listVal? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TensorList A list of tensor values.
---@field intVal? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.IntegerList INT_8 INT_16 INT_32
