---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TextResponseFormat
---@field mimeType? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1TextResponseFormatMimeTypeEnum|string Optional. The IANA standard MIME type of the response.
---@field schema? any Optional. The JSON schema that the output should conform to. Only applicable when mime_type is APPLICATION_JSON.

