---The config for feature monitoring threshold.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ThresholdConfig
---@field value? number Specify a threshold value that can trigger the alert. If this threshold config is for feature distribution distance: 1. For categorical feature, the distribution distance is calculated by L-inifinity norm. 2. For numerical feature, the distribution distance is calculated by Jensen–Shannon divergence. Each feature must have a non-zero threshold if they need to be monitored. Otherwise no alert will be triggered for that feature.

---@alias gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ThresholdConfigMap { [string]: gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ThresholdConfig }

