---ParallelAiSearch tool type. A tool that uses the Parallel.ai search engine for grounding.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolParallelAiSearch
---@field enableDataRetention? boolean Optional. Deprecated: Use `enable_zero_data_retention` instead. Instructs Vertex Grounding to use Parallel's Zero Data Retention Marketplace product. If this value is "false" or omitted, the Parallel Web Search for Grounding standard subscription will be used. If this value is "true", the Parallel Web Search for Grounding - ZDR subscription will be used.
---@field apiKey? string Optional. The API key for ParallelAiSearch. If an API key is not provided, the system will attempt to verify access by checking for an active Parallel.ai subscription through the Google Cloud Marketplace. See https://docs.parallel.ai/search/search-quickstart for more details.
---@field enableZeroDataRetention? boolean Optional. Instructs Vertex Grounding to use Parallel's Zero Data Retention Marketplace product. If this value is "false" or omitted, the Parallel Web Search for Grounding standard subscription will be used. If this value is "true", the Parallel Web Search for Grounding - ZDR subscription will be used.
---@field customConfigs? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DocumentMap Optional. Custom configs for ParallelAiSearch. This field can be used to pass any parameter from the Parallel.ai Search API. See the Parallel.ai documentation for the full list of available parameters and their usage: https://docs.parallel.ai/api-reference/search-beta/search Currently only `source_policy`, `excerpts`, `max_results`, `mode`, `fetch_policy` can be set via this field. For example: { "source_policy": { "include_domains": ["google.com", "wikipedia.org"], "exclude_domains": ["example.com"] }, "fetch_policy": { "max_age_seconds": 3600 } }

