---Response message for GenAiTuningService.ValidateReinforcementTuningReward.
---@class gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ValidateReinforcementTuningRewardResponse
---@field errorStatus? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. In case of an error, this field will be populated with a detailed error message for overall rewards to help with debugging.
---@field rewardDetails? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.DoubleMap Output only. Deprecated: Use reward_info_details instead. A map from reward name to the calculated reward for the reward function. This field will only be populated when a CompositeReinforcementTuningRewardConfig is provided in the request. It will not be set for a SingleReinforcementTuningRewardConfig.
---@field error? string Output only. Deprecated: Use error_status instead. In case of an error, this field will be populated with a detailed error message to help with debugging.
---@field rewardInfoDetails? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ReinforcementTuningRewardInfoMap A map from reward name to reward info.
---@field overallReward? number Output only. The overall weighted reward. For a CompositeReinforcementTuningRewardConfig, this is the weighted average of all rewards. For a SingleReinforcementTuningRewardConfig, this will be the value of the single reward.

