---@field name? string Optional. Optional label used for reporting (e.g. "tests-green").
---@field autoVerification? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1AutoVerification Automated. Judged against the goal's own `spec`.
---@field required? boolean Optional. If true, the goal cannot be marked COMPLETED unless this verifier passes. If false, the verifier is advisory (recorded, non-blocking).
---@field state? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1VerifierStateEnum|string Output only. The verifier's latest verdict.
---@field nlCriteria? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1NlCriteria Automated. A customizable natural-language rubric an autorater/agent evaluates.

