---@field avroSource? gcp.unstable.aiplatform_v1beta1.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1AvroSource
---@field disableOnlineServing? boolean If set, data will not be imported for online serving. This is typically used for backfilling, where Feature generation timestamps are not in the timestamp range needed for online serving.
---@field entityIdField? string Source column that holds entity IDs. If not provided, entity IDs are extracted from the column named entity_id.
